window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b013-2a2f9f3da00521ed.json"]={sha256:"2a2f9f3da00521edae893f3c7987f8ca42a526a7ffde775bb7dc55fa240a4284",value:{"id":"b013","title":"諾曼第大橋","titleEn":"Pont de Normandie","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"諾曼第大橋 1995 年通車時以 856 m 主跨創下斜張橋紀錄：主跨中央 624 m 為正交異性鋼箱梁，兩端各 116 m 與背跨為預力混凝土，184 根鋼絞線斜索掛在兩座約 214 m 高的倒 Y 形混凝土塔上。本課從混合主梁的重量配置、倒 Y 形塔的抗扭貢獻、斜索與樁基，經混凝土平衡懸臂與鋼節段吊裝，到現地風量測、長索振動與阻尼器加裝、斜索多層防腐與單股更換。","summaryEn":"When it opened in 1995 the Pont de Normandie set the cable-stayed span record at 856 m: the central 624 m of the main span is an orthotropic steel box, while 116 m at each end and the back spans are prestressed concrete, and 184 strand stays hang from two inverted-Y concrete pylons about 214 m tall. The course runs from the weight layout of the hybrid deck, the torsional contribution of the inverted-Y pylons, stays and piles, through concrete balanced cantilevers and steel-segment lifting, to on-site wind measurement, long-stay vibration and retrofitted dampers, multi-layer stay corrosion protection and single-strand replacement.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-cable-stayed","subcategoryTitle":"斜張橋與斜索系統","subcategoryTitleEn":"Cable-stayed bridges and stay systems","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-cable-stayed","learningTags":["structures","st-cable-stayed","cablestayed"],"architectureFamily":"cablestayed","architectureNodes":[["樁基與塔承台","Piles and pylon caps"],["倒 Y 形混凝土塔","Inverted-Y concrete pylons"],["184 根鋼絞線斜索","184 strand stays"],["近塔混凝土箱梁","Concrete box near pylons"],["跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁","Central 624 m steel box"],["阻尼器與檢查維護","Dampers, inspection and maintenance"]],"architectureEdges":[[1,0],[2,1],[3,2],[4,2],[4,3],[2,5]],"diagram":{"type":"cablestayed","labels":["樁基與塔承台","倒 Y 形混凝土塔","184 根鋼絞線斜索","近塔混凝土箱梁","跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁"],"labelsEn":["Piles and pylon caps","Inverted-Y concrete pylons","184 strand stays","Concrete box near pylons","Central 624 m steel box"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：估算鋼與混凝土兩種中央段方案對單根長索的影響。設主跨中央某根長索負擔 19.65 m 的節段，鋼橋面 10 t/m 時恆載 W = 19.65×10 ≈ 197 t（約 1,930 kN）；若改為 40 t/m 的混凝土，W = 786 t（約 7,710 kN）。斜索與水平夾角 θ = 25°，sin25° ≈ 0.423，鋼方案索力 T = 1,930/0.423 ≈ 4,560 kN，混凝土方案 T ≈ 7,710/0.423 ≈ 18,240 kN。以每股使用拉力 10 t（約 98 kN）計，鋼方案需約 4,560/98 ≈ 47 股，混凝土方案需約 186 股，超過 53 股的上限三倍以上。若夾角提高到 30°（sin30° = 0.5），鋼方案索力降為約 3,860 kN、約 40 股。數值為教學假設，未計活載與動力效應。","textEn":"Design exercise: compare the effect of steel and concrete central zones on one long stay. Suppose a long stay near mid-span supports a 19.65 m segment; at 10 t/m for a steel deck the dead load is W = 19.65×10 ≈ 197 t (about 1,930 kN), while a 40 t/m concrete deck gives W = 786 t (about 7,710 kN). At θ = 25° to the horizontal, sin25° ≈ 0.423, so the steel option needs T = 1,930/0.423 ≈ 4,560 kN and the concrete option T ≈ 7,710/0.423 ≈ 18,240 kN. At a service tension of 10 t (about 98 kN) per strand, the steel option needs about 4,560/98 ≈ 47 strands and the concrete option about 186, more than three times the 53-strand maximum. Raising the angle to 30° (sin30° = 0.5) lowers the steel option to about 3,860 kN, about 40 strands. Values are teaching assumptions excluding live load and dynamic effects.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b013-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼」與「倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span\" and \"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b013-v13-01","title":"混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Central 624 m steel box” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"諾曼第大橋的主跨 856 m 由三段組成：從塔向河中伸出的 116 m 混凝土懸臂，以及中央 624 m 的鋼箱梁。官方技術資料列出混凝土橋面每公尺約 33 至 50 t，鋼橋面只有約 8 至 11 t。斜張橋主跨的重量對塔的力矩與距離成正比，越遠的重量越「貴」：把輕的鋼梁放在力臂最長的跨中，把重的混凝土放在靠近塔、力臂短的位置，同時讓背跨的混凝土高架橋成為天然壓重。這種配置降低了塔與背跨錨固的需求，是當時能把跨徑大幅推進的關鍵。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The 856 m main span of the Pont de Normandie has three parts: a 116 m concrete cantilever reaching out from each pylon and a central 624 m steel box. The official technical sheet lists the concrete deck at about 33 to 50 t per metre and the steel deck at only about 8 to 11 t. Main-span weight acts on the pylon in proportion to its distance, so remote weight is the most costly: placing the light steel girder at mid-span where the lever arm is longest and the heavy concrete near the pylon where it is short, while the concrete back-span viaduct acts as natural ballast, reduces the demand on pylons and back-span anchorage. This layout was key to the large jump in span at the time. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Central 624 m steel box” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：半個主跨對塔的力矩 M = Σ w·l·x̄。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Half-span moment about the pylon M = Σ w·l·x̄.","failure":"常見誤解：「大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Central 624 m steel box”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-01-k1","title":"混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼","titleEn":"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span","text":"諾曼第大橋的主跨 856 m 由三段組成：從塔向河中伸出的 116 m 混凝土懸臂，以及中央 624 m 的鋼箱梁。官方技術資料列出混凝土橋面每公尺約 33 至 50 t，鋼橋面只有約 8 至 11 t。","textEn":"The 856 m main span of the Pont de Normandie has three parts: a 116 m concrete cantilever reaching out from each pylon and a central 624 m steel box. The official technical sheet lists the concrete deck at about 33 to 50 t per metre and the steel deck at only about 8 to 11 t.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span\" is correct?","options":["大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。","諾曼第大橋的主跨 856 m 由三段組成：從塔向河中伸出的 116 m 混凝土懸臂，以及中央 624 m 的鋼箱梁。","塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight.","The 856 m main span of the Pont de Normandie has three parts: a 116 m concrete cantilever reaching out from each pylon and a central 624 m steel box.","Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"諾曼第大橋的主跨 856 m 由三段組成：從塔向河中伸出的 116 m 混凝土懸臂，以及中央 624 m 的鋼箱梁。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The 856 m main span of the Pont de Normandie has three parts: a 116 m concrete cantilever reaching out from each pylon and a central 624 m steel box. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b013-v13-02","title":"混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼：定量估算","titleEn":"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Central 624 m steel box” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：半個主跨對塔的力矩 M = Σ w·l·x̄。混凝土 116 m×40 t/m = 4,640 t，力臂 58 m，得 269,120 t·m；鋼梁 312 m×10 t/m = 3,120 t，力臂 116 + 156 = 272 m，得 848,640 t·m；合計約 1,117,760 t·m。若 428 m 全用 40 t/m 混凝土，M = 17,120×214 ≈ 3,663,680 t·m，約 3.3 倍。單位重取公開範圍內的教學值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Half-span moment about the pylon M = Σ w·l·x̄. Concrete: 116 m×40 t/m = 4,640 t at 58 m gives 269,120 t·m; steel: 312 m×10 t/m = 3,120 t at 116 + 156 = 272 m gives 848,640 t·m; total about 1,117,760 t·m. If all 428 m were 40 t/m concrete, M = 17,120×214 ≈ 3,663,680 t·m, about 3.3 times larger. Unit weights are teaching values within the published ranges. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以施工階段分析逐段累積塔底彎矩與背跨支承反力，與鋼、混凝土實際秤重或體積換算的重量比對；混凝土段每節以實際澆置量更新重量，鋼節段出廠秤重，偏差超過容許時調整後續斜索力或背跨壓重。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Accumulate pylon-base moment and back-span reactions segment by segment in the staged analysis and compare with weights from actual steel weighing and concrete volumes; update each concrete segment with its as-cast volume, weigh steel segments at the factory, and adjust later stay forces or back-span ballast when deviations exceed tolerance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"半個主跨對塔的力矩 M = Σ w·l·x̄。混凝土 116 m×40 t/m = 4,640 t，力臂 58 m，得 269,120 t·m；鋼梁 312 m×10 t/m = 3,120 t，力臂 116 + 156 = 272 m，得 848,640 t·m；合計約 1,117,760 t·m。若 428 m 全用 40 t/m 混凝土，M = 17,120×214 ≈ 3,663,680 t·m，約 3.3 倍。單位重取公開範圍內的教學值。","textEn":"Half-span moment about the pylon M = Σ w·l·x̄. Concrete: 116 m×40 t/m = 4,640 t at 58 m gives 269,120 t·m; steel: 312 m×10 t/m = 3,120 t at 116 + 156 = 272 m gives 848,640 t·m; total about 1,117,760 t·m. If all 428 m were 40 t/m concrete, M = 17,120×214 ≈ 3,663,680 t·m, about 3.3 times larger. Unit weights are teaching values within the published ranges.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span\", which statement holds?","options":["塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。","斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","半個主跨對塔的力矩 M = Σ w·l·x̄。"],"optionsEn":["If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter.","Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","Half-span moment about the pylon M = Σ w·l·x̄."],"answer":2,"explanation":"半個主跨對塔的力矩 M = Σ w·l·x̄。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Half-span moment about the pylon M = Σ w·l·x̄. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b013-v13-03","title":"混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Central 624 m steel box” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以施工階段分析逐段累積塔底彎矩與背跨支承反力，與鋼、混凝土實際秤重或體積換算的重量比對；混凝土段每節以實際澆置量更新重量，鋼節段出廠秤重，偏差超過容許時調整後續斜索力或背跨壓重。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Accumulate pylon-base moment and back-span reactions segment by segment in the staged analysis and compare with weights from actual steel weighing and concrete volumes; update each concrete segment with its as-cast volume, weigh steel segments at the factory, and adjust later stay forces or back-span ballast when deviations exceed tolerance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：混合主梁的設計文件應列出每段的設計單位重、容許偏差與量測方式，並把鋼混分界處的重量與勁度變化納入施工控制；重量偏差超過約 3% 時須由設計者重新評估。","observationEn":"Site practice: Hybrid-deck documents should list each zone’s design unit weight, tolerance and measurement method and include the weight and stiffness change at the steel–concrete boundary in construction control; deviations beyond about 3% require reassessment by the designer.","failure":"注意干擾：若混凝土段實際重量高於設計（例如超厚或模板變形），塔身與背跨錨固承受額外彎矩，跨中鋼梁的線形也會隨之改變；鋼梁若因設計變更增重而未重算，塔頂偏位與斜索力會偏離預測。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If concrete segments end up heavier than designed, for example through over-thickness or formwork distortion, pylons and back-span anchorage take extra moment and the steel mid-span profile shifts; added steel weight from design changes not reanalysed pushes pylon-top displacement and stay forces away from prediction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以施工階段分析逐段累積塔底彎矩與背跨支承反力，與鋼、混凝土實際秤重或體積換算的重量比對；混凝土段每節以實際澆置量更新重量，鋼節段出廠秤重，偏差超過容許時調整後續斜索力或背跨壓重。","textEn":"Accumulate pylon-base moment and back-span reactions segment by segment in the staged analysis and compare with weights from actual steel weighing and concrete volumes; update each concrete segment with its as-cast volume, weigh steel segments at the factory, and adjust later stay forces or back-span ballast when deviations exceed tolerance.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"混合主梁的設計文件應列出每段的設計單位重、容許偏差與量測方式，並把鋼混分界處的重量與勁度變化納入施工控制；重量偏差超過約 3% 時須由設計者重新評估。","textEn":"Hybrid-deck documents should list each zone’s design unit weight, tolerance and measurement method and include the weight and stiffness change at the steel–concrete boundary in construction control; deviations beyond about 3% require reassessment by the designer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span\"?","options":["以施工階段分析逐段累積塔底彎矩與背跨支承反力，與鋼、混凝土實際秤重或體積換算的重量比對。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。"],"optionsEn":["Accumulate pylon-base moment and back-span reactions segment by segment in the staged analysis and compare with weights from actual steel weighing and concrete volumes.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以施工階段分析逐段累積塔底彎矩與背跨支承反力，與鋼、混凝土實際秤重或體積換算的重量比對；混凝土段每節以實際澆置量更新重量，鋼節段出廠秤重，偏差超過容許時調整後續斜索力或背跨壓重。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Accumulate pylon-base moment and back-span reactions segment by segment in the staged analysis and compare with weights from actual steel weighing and concrete volumes; update each concrete segment with its as-cast volume, weigh steel segments at the factory, and adjust later stay forces or back-span ballast when deviations exceed tolerance. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b013-v13-04","title":"混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨中 624 m 鋼箱梁」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Central 624 m steel box” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若混凝土段實際重量高於設計（例如超厚或模板變形），塔身與背跨錨固承受額外彎矩，跨中鋼梁的線形也會隨之改變；鋼梁若因設計變更增重而未重算，塔頂偏位與斜索力會偏離預測。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If concrete segments end up heavier than designed, for example through over-thickness or formwork distortion, pylons and back-span anchorage take extra moment and the steel mid-span profile shifts; added steel weight from design changes not reanalysed pushes pylon-top displacement and stay forces away from prediction. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這種配置降低了塔與背跨錨固的需求，是當時能把跨徑大幅推進的關鍵。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This layout was key to the large jump in span at the time.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若混凝土段實際重量高於設計（例如超厚或模板變形），塔身與背跨錨固承受額外彎矩，跨中鋼梁的線形也會隨之改變；鋼梁若因設計變更增重而未重算，塔頂偏位與斜索力會偏離預測。","textEn":"If concrete segments end up heavier than designed, for example through over-thickness or formwork distortion, pylons and back-span anchorage take extra moment and the steel mid-span profile shifts; added steel weight from design changes not reanalysed pushes pylon-top displacement and stay forces away from prediction.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「混合主梁：近塔用混凝土、跨中用鋼」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hybrid deck: concrete near the pylons, steel at mid-span\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若混凝土段實際重量高於設計（例如超厚或模板變形），塔身與背跨錨固承受額外彎矩，跨中鋼梁的線形也會隨之改變。","塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","If concrete segments end up heavier than designed, for example through over-thickness or formwork distortion, pylons and back-span anchorage take extra moment and the steel mid-span profile shifts.","Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若混凝土段實際重量高於設計（例如超厚或模板變形），塔身與背跨錨固承受額外彎矩，跨中鋼梁的線形也會隨之改變；鋼梁若因設計變更增重而未重算，塔頂偏位與斜索力會偏離預測。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If concrete segments end up heavier than designed, for example through over-thickness or formwork distortion, pylons and back-span anchorage take extra moment and the steel mid-span profile shifts; added steel weight from design changes not reanalysed pushes pylon-top displacement and stay forces away from prediction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b013-v13-05","title":"倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Inverted-Y concrete pylons” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"兩座塔高約 214 m、各重約 20,000 t，為預力混凝土倒 Y 形，兩肢向內傾斜，使塔以受壓為主。兩個斜索面從橋面兩側向上收斂到塔頂，從橫斷面看，斜索、橋面與塔肢形成三角形，橋面若要扭轉，一側斜索必須伸長、另一側縮短，斜索的軸向勁度因此直接提供扭轉勁度。這對主跨 856 m、寬約 23.6 m 的細長橋面非常重要，因為扭轉頻率與彎曲頻率的比值越高，扭轉顫振越不容易發生。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The two pylons are prestressed concrete inverted Y shapes about 214 m tall and about 20,000 t each, with legs leaning inward so the pylon works mainly in compression. The two cable planes rise from both deck edges and converge at the pylon head; in cross-section, stays, deck and pylon legs form a triangle, so twisting the deck requires one plane of stays to lengthen and the other to shorten, and their axial stiffness directly supplies torsional stiffness. This matters greatly for an 856 m main span with a deck only about 23.6 m wide, because the higher the ratio of torsional to bending frequency, the less likely torsional flutter becomes. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Inverted-Y concrete pylons” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：塔肢軸力 N = V/(2cosθ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Leg force N = V/(2cosθ).","failure":"常見誤解：「塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Inverted-Y concrete pylons”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-05-k1","title":"倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用","titleEn":"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes","text":"兩座塔高約 214 m、各重約 20,000 t，為預力混凝土倒 Y 形，兩肢向內傾斜，使塔以受壓為主。兩個斜索面從橋面兩側向上收斂到塔頂，從橫斷面看，斜索、橋面與塔肢形成三角形，橋面若要扭轉，一側斜索必須伸長、另一側縮短，斜索的軸向勁度因此直接提供扭轉勁度。","textEn":"The two pylons are prestressed concrete inverted Y shapes about 214 m tall and about 20,000 t each, with legs leaning inward so the pylon works mainly in compression. The two cable planes rise from both deck edges and converge at the pylon head; in cross-section, stays, deck and pylon legs form a triangle, so twisting the deck requires one plane of stays to lengthen and the other to shorten, and their axial stiffness directly supplies torsional stiffness.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes\" is correct?","options":["塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。","斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。","兩座塔高約 214 m、各重約 20,000 t，為預力混凝土倒 Y 形，兩肢向內傾斜，使塔以受壓為主。"],"optionsEn":["Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance.","As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.","The two pylons are prestressed concrete inverted Y shapes about 214 m tall and about 20,000 t each, with legs leaning inward so the pylon works mainly in compression."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩座塔高約 214 m、各重約 20,000 t，為預力混凝土倒 Y 形，兩肢向內傾斜，使塔以受壓為主。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The two pylons are prestressed concrete inverted Y shapes about 214 m tall and about 20,000 t each, with legs leaning inward so the pylon works mainly in compression. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b013-v13-06","title":"倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用：定量估算","titleEn":"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Inverted-Y concrete pylons” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：塔肢軸力 N = V/(2cosθ)。若塔頂合計垂直力 V = 400 MN、肢與鉛垂夾角 θ = 10°：N = 400/(2×0.985) ≈ 203 MN；若 θ 增為 20°，N = 400/(2×0.940) ≈ 213 MN，但肢底的水平推力 N·sinθ 由約 35 MN 增至約 73 MN，需由橫梁或基礎承擔。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Leg force N = V/(2cosθ). With a total vertical force V = 400 MN at the head and legs at θ = 10° from vertical, N = 400/(2×0.985) ≈ 203 MN; at θ = 20°, N = 400/(2×0.940) ≈ 213 MN, but the horizontal thrust at the leg base, N·sinθ, grows from about 35 MN to about 73 MN, to be carried by a cross beam or the foundation. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以模態分析取得橋面一階垂直彎曲與一階扭轉頻率，計算頻率比並與風洞顫振試驗結果比較；施工中量測兩肢的垂直度與交會點座標，確認斜索錨點位置與設計一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Obtain the first vertical bending and torsional frequencies from modal analysis, compute their ratio and compare with flutter test results; during construction survey the verticality of both legs and the coordinates of their meeting point to confirm stay anchor positions match the design.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"塔肢軸力 N = V/(2cosθ)。若塔頂合計垂直力 V = 400 MN、肢與鉛垂夾角 θ = 10°：N = 400/(2×0.985) ≈ 203 MN；若 θ 增為 20°，N = 400/(2×0.940) ≈ 213 MN，但肢底的水平推力 N·sinθ 由約 35 MN 增至約 73 MN，需由橫梁或基礎承擔。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Leg force N = V/(2cosθ). With a total vertical force V = 400 MN at the head and legs at θ = 10° from vertical, N = 400/(2×0.985) ≈ 203 MN; at θ = 20°, N = 400/(2×0.940) ≈ 213 MN, but the horizontal thrust at the leg base, N·sinθ, grows from about 35 MN to about 73 MN, to be carried by a cross beam or the foundation. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes\", which statement holds?","options":["塔肢軸力 N = V/(2cosθ)。","混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。","只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。"],"optionsEn":["Leg force N = V/(2cosθ).","A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered.","Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"塔肢軸力 N = V/(2cosθ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Leg force N = V/(2cosθ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b013-v13-07","title":"倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Inverted-Y concrete pylons” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以模態分析取得橋面一階垂直彎曲與一階扭轉頻率，計算頻率比並與風洞顫振試驗結果比較；施工中量測兩肢的垂直度與交會點座標，確認斜索錨點位置與設計一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Obtain the first vertical bending and torsional frequencies from modal analysis, compute their ratio and compare with flutter test results; during construction survey the verticality of both legs and the coordinates of their meeting point to confirm stay anchor positions match the design. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：塔型選擇報告應同時列出頻率比、顫振臨界風速與塔肢內力的比較；塔肢交會區與錨固區的鋼筋、預力配置要以三維模型檢查施工可行性，避免混凝土澆置不密實。","observationEn":"Site practice: The pylon-form study should compare frequency ratio, flutter speed and leg forces together; reinforcement and prestress at the leg junction and anchorage zone should be checked for buildability in a 3D model to avoid poorly compacted concrete.","failure":"注意干擾：若改為兩個平行的垂直索面（H 形塔）而未補足扭轉勁度，細長橋面的扭轉頻率下降，顫振臨界風速可能大幅降低；塔肢交會處的局部應力若設計不足，預力或鋼筋配置不當會出現裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Switching to two parallel vertical cable planes on an H-shaped pylon without compensating torsional stiffness lowers the slender deck’s torsional frequency and can sharply reduce the flutter speed; inadequate design of the leg junction leads to cracking where prestress or reinforcement is poorly arranged. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以模態分析取得橋面一階垂直彎曲與一階扭轉頻率，計算頻率比並與風洞顫振試驗結果比較；施工中量測兩肢的垂直度與交會點座標，確認斜索錨點位置與設計一致。","textEn":"Obtain the first vertical bending and torsional frequencies from modal analysis, compute their ratio and compare with flutter test results; during construction survey the verticality of both legs and the coordinates of their meeting point to confirm stay anchor positions match the design.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"塔型選擇報告應同時列出頻率比、顫振臨界風速與塔肢內力的比較；塔肢交會區與錨固區的鋼筋、預力配置要以三維模型檢查施工可行性，避免混凝土澆置不密實。","textEn":"The pylon-form study should compare frequency ratio, flutter speed and leg forces together; reinforcement and prestress at the leg junction and anchorage zone should be checked for buildability in a 3D model to avoid poorly compacted concrete.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以模態分析取得橋面一階垂直彎曲與一階扭轉頻率，計算頻率比並與風洞顫振試驗結果比較；施工中量測兩肢的垂直度與交會點座標，確認斜索錨點位置與設計一致。","斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Obtain the first vertical bending and torsional frequencies from modal analysis, compute their ratio and compare with flutter test results.","With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以模態分析取得橋面一階垂直彎曲與一階扭轉頻率，計算頻率比並與風洞顫振試驗結果比較；施工中量測兩肢的垂直度與交會點座標，確認斜索錨點位置與設計一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Obtain the first vertical bending and torsional frequencies from modal analysis, compute their ratio and compare with flutter test results; during construction survey the verticality of both legs and the coordinates of their meeting point to confirm stay anchor positions match the design. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b013-v13-08","title":"倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用：失效診斷","titleEn":"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「倒 Y 形混凝土塔」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Inverted-Y concrete pylons” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若改為兩個平行的垂直索面（H 形塔）而未補足扭轉勁度，細長橋面的扭轉頻率下降，顫振臨界風速可能大幅降低；塔肢交會處的局部應力若設計不足，預力或鋼筋配置不當會出現裂縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Switching to two parallel vertical cable planes on an H-shaped pylon without compensating torsional stiffness lowers the slender deck’s torsional frequency and can sharply reduce the flutter speed; inadequate design of the leg junction leads to cracking where prestress or reinforcement is poorly arranged. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這對主跨 856 m、寬約 23.6 m 的細長橋面非常重要，因為扭轉頻率與彎曲頻率的比值越高，扭轉顫振越不容易發生。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This matters greatly for an 856 m main span with a deck only about 23.6 m wide, because the higher the ratio of torsional to bending frequency, the less likely torsional flutter becomes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若改為兩個平行的垂直索面（H 形塔）而未補足扭轉勁度，細長橋面的扭轉頻率下降，顫振臨界風速可能大幅降低；塔肢交會處的局部應力若設計不足，預力或鋼筋配置不當會出現裂縫。","textEn":"Switching to two parallel vertical cable planes on an H-shaped pylon without compensating torsional stiffness lowers the slender deck’s torsional frequency and can sharply reduce the flutter speed; inadequate design of the leg junction leads to cracking where prestress or reinforcement is poorly arranged.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「倒 Y 形塔與雙索面的抗扭作用」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Inverted-Y pylons and torsional action of two cable planes\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。","若改為兩個平行的垂直索面（H 形塔）而未補足扭轉勁度，細長橋面的扭轉頻率下降，顫振臨界風速可能大幅降低。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.","Switching to two parallel vertical cable planes on an H-shaped pylon without compensating torsional stiffness lowers the slender deck’s torsional frequency and can sharply reduce the flutter speed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若改為兩個平行的垂直索面（H 形塔）而未補足扭轉勁度，細長橋面的扭轉頻率下降，顫振臨界風速可能大幅降低；塔肢交會處的局部應力若設計不足，預力或鋼筋配置不當會出現裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Switching to two parallel vertical cable planes on an H-shaped pylon without compensating torsional stiffness lowers the slender deck’s torsional frequency and can sharply reduce the flutter speed; inadequate design of the leg junction leads to cracking where prestress or reinforcement is poorly arranged. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b013-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力」與「塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays\" and \"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b013-v13-09","title":"平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「184 根鋼絞線斜索」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “184 strand stays” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"官方技術資料列出全橋 184 根斜索（8 組 × 23 根），每根由 31 至 53 股直徑 15.7 mm 的鋼絞線組成，長度約 95 m 至 460 m。每股鋼絞線破斷力約 27 t，使用拉力約 10 t。平行鋼絞線斜索的優點是可以逐股安裝與張拉，不需要一次吊起整根數十噸的成品索，日後也可以逐股抽換；缺點是每股之間的力量必須均勻，否則受力最大的那股會先疲勞或鬆弛。斜索在中央鋼梁段與混凝土段的錨固方式不同，錨具要分別配合鋼錨箱與混凝土錨塊。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「184 根鋼絞線斜索」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The official technical sheet lists 184 stays (8 groups × 23), each made of 31 to 53 strands of 15.7 mm diameter and about 95 m to 460 m long. Each strand has a breaking load of about 27 t and a service tension of about 10 t. Parallel-strand stays can be installed and stressed strand by strand, avoiding lifting a finished cable weighing tens of tonnes, and strands can later be replaced one at a time; the catch is that force must be even among strands, or the most heavily loaded one fatigues or relaxes first. Anchorage differs between the central steel zone and the concrete zones, so anchorages must suit steel anchor boxes and concrete anchor blocks respectively. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “184 strand stays” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：使用應力比 = 10/27 ≈ 37% 的破斷力；最大 53 股斜索破斷力 53×27 = 1,431 t、使用力 53×10 = 530 t。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Service ratio = 10/27 ≈ 37% of breaking load; the largest 53-strand stay has 53×27 = 1,431 t breaking and 53×10 = 530 t service force.","failure":"常見誤解：「斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「184 根鋼絞線斜索」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “184 strand stays”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-09-k1","title":"平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力","titleEn":"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays","text":"官方技術資料列出全橋 184 根斜索（8 組 × 23 根），每根由 31 至 53 股直徑 15.7 mm 的鋼絞線組成，長度約 95 m 至 460 m。每股鋼絞線破斷力約 27 t，使用拉力約 10 t。","textEn":"The official technical sheet lists 184 stays (8 groups × 23), each made of 31 to 53 strands of 15.7 mm diameter and about 95 m to 460 m long. Each strand has a breaking load of about 27 t and a service tension of about 10 t.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays\" is correct?","options":["官方技術資料列出全橋 184 根斜索（8 組 × 23 根），每根由 31 至 53 股直徑 15.7 mm 的鋼絞線組成，長度約 95 m 至 460 m。","斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。","塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。"],"optionsEn":["The official technical sheet lists 184 stays (8 groups × 23), each made of 31 to 53 strands of 15.7 mm diameter and about 95 m to 460 m long.","As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.","If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"官方技術資料列出全橋 184 根斜索（8 組 × 23 根），每根由 31 至 53 股直徑 15.7 mm 的鋼絞線組成，長度約 95 m 至 460 m。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The official technical sheet lists 184 stays (8 groups × 23), each made of 31 to 53 strands of 15.7 mm diameter and about 95 m to 460 m long. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b013-v13-10","title":"平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力：定量估算","titleEn":"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「184 根鋼絞線斜索」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “184 strand stays” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：使用應力比 = 10/27 ≈ 37% 的破斷力；最大 53 股斜索破斷力 53×27 = 1,431 t、使用力 53×10 = 530 t。15.7 mm 鋼絞線截面約 150 mm²，以 1,860 MPa 計破斷力約 279 kN（約 28 t），與官方 27 t 相近。截面與強度等級為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Service ratio = 10/27 ≈ 37% of breaking load; the largest 53-strand stay has 53×27 = 1,431 t breaking and 53×10 = 530 t service force. A 15.7 mm strand of about 150 mm² at 1,860 MPa breaks at about 279 kN (about 28 t), close to the official 27 t. Section and grade are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：鋼絞線每批做拉伸、鬆弛與疲勞試驗，錨具組裝體依斜索規範做疲勞後破斷試驗；安裝後抽查各股力量的均勻度（例如以單股千斤頂舉升檢測），並記錄每根索的總力與各股最大偏差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Test each strand lot for tension, relaxation and fatigue and test anchorage assemblies for residual strength after fatigue under stay-cable recommendations; after installation spot-check strand-force uniformity, for example by single-strand lift-off, and record each stay’s total force and maximum strand deviation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"使用應力比 = 10/27 ≈ 37% 的破斷力；最大 53 股斜索破斷力 53×27 = 1,431 t、使用力 53×10 = 530 t。15.7 mm 鋼絞線截面約 150 mm²，以 1,860 MPa 計破斷力約 279 kN（約 28 t），與官方 27 t 相近。截面與強度等級為教學假設。","textEn":"Service ratio = 10/27 ≈ 37% of breaking load; the largest 53-strand stay has 53×27 = 1,431 t breaking and 53×10 = 530 t service force. A 15.7 mm strand of about 150 mm² at 1,860 MPa breaks at about 279 kN (about 28 t), close to the official 27 t. Section and grade are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays\", which statement holds?","options":["斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","使用應力比 = 10/27 ≈ 37% 的破斷力；最大 53 股斜索破斷力 53×27 = 1,431 t、使用力 53×10 = 530 t。","斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。"],"optionsEn":["Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","Service ratio = 10/27 ≈ 37% of breaking load; the largest 53-strand stay has 53×27 = 1,431 t breaking and 53×10 = 530 t service force.","Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life."],"answer":1,"explanation":"使用應力比 = 10/27 ≈ 37% 的破斷力；最大 53 股斜索破斷力 53×27 = 1,431 t、使用力 53×10 = 530 t。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Service ratio = 10/27 ≈ 37% of breaking load; the largest 53-strand stay has 53×27 = 1,431 t breaking and 53×10 = 530 t service force. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b013-v13-11","title":"平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「184 根鋼絞線斜索」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “184 strand stays” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"鋼絞線每批做拉伸、鬆弛與疲勞試驗，錨具組裝體依斜索規範做疲勞後破斷試驗；安裝後抽查各股力量的均勻度（例如以單股千斤頂舉升檢測），並記錄每根索的總力與各股最大偏差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Test each strand lot for tension, relaxation and fatigue and test anchorage assemblies for residual strength after fatigue under stay-cable recommendations; after installation spot-check strand-force uniformity, for example by single-strand lift-off, and record each stay’s total force and maximum strand deviation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：斜索安裝規範要寫明各股力量容許偏差、量測方法與抽查比例，並規定錨具防水帽與填充材料的施工檢查；每根索的安裝紀錄要能追溯到鋼絞線批號。","observationEn":"Site practice: The stay installation specification should state the allowable strand-force deviation, measurement method and sampling rate and require checks on anchorage caps and filler; each stay’s record must trace back to strand lot numbers.","failure":"注意干擾：若各股力量不均，受力最大的鋼絞線在活載與風振下承受較大應力幅，可能先在錨口疲勞斷裂，隨後負荷轉移到其他股，形成漸進劣化；錨具夾片咬合不良則可能滑移。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Uneven strand forces subject the most loaded strand to larger stress ranges under traffic and wind vibration, so it may fatigue at the anchor exit first and shift load to others in progressive deterioration; poorly seated wedges can slip. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"鋼絞線每批做拉伸、鬆弛與疲勞試驗，錨具組裝體依斜索規範做疲勞後破斷試驗；安裝後抽查各股力量的均勻度（例如以單股千斤頂舉升檢測），並記錄每根索的總力與各股最大偏差。","textEn":"Test each strand lot for tension, relaxation and fatigue and test anchorage assemblies for residual strength after fatigue under stay-cable recommendations; after installation spot-check strand-force uniformity, for example by single-strand lift-off, and record each stay’s total force and maximum strand deviation.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"斜索安裝規範要寫明各股力量容許偏差、量測方法與抽查比例，並規定錨具防水帽與填充材料的施工檢查；每根索的安裝紀錄要能追溯到鋼絞線批號。","textEn":"The stay installation specification should state the allowable strand-force deviation, measurement method and sampling rate and require checks on anchorage caps and filler; each stay’s record must trace back to strand lot numbers.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。","鋼絞線每批做拉伸、鬆弛與疲勞試驗，錨具組裝體依斜索規範做疲勞後破斷試驗。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed.","Test each strand lot for tension, relaxation and fatigue and test anchorage assemblies for residual strength after fatigue under stay-cable recommendations."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鋼絞線每批做拉伸、鬆弛與疲勞試驗，錨具組裝體依斜索規範做疲勞後破斷試驗；安裝後抽查各股力量的均勻度（例如以單股千斤頂舉升檢測），並記錄每根索的總力與各股最大偏差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Test each strand lot for tension, relaxation and fatigue and test anchorage assemblies for residual strength after fatigue under stay-cable recommendations; after installation spot-check strand-force uniformity, for example by single-strand lift-off, and record each stay’s total force and maximum strand deviation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b013-v13-12","title":"平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「184 根鋼絞線斜索」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “184 strand stays” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若各股力量不均，受力最大的鋼絞線在活載與風振下承受較大應力幅，可能先在錨口疲勞斷裂，隨後負荷轉移到其他股，形成漸進劣化；錨具夾片咬合不良則可能滑移。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Uneven strand forces subject the most loaded strand to larger stress ranges under traffic and wind vibration, so it may fatigue at the anchor exit first and shift load to others in progressive deterioration; poorly seated wedges can slip. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：斜索在中央鋼梁段與混凝土段的錨固方式不同，錨具要分別配合鋼錨箱與混凝土錨塊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Anchorage differs between the central steel zone and the concrete zones, so anchorages must suit steel anchor boxes and concrete anchor blocks respectively.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若各股力量不均，受力最大的鋼絞線在活載與風振下承受較大應力幅，可能先在錨口疲勞斷裂，隨後負荷轉移到其他股，形成漸進劣化；錨具夾片咬合不良則可能滑移。","textEn":"Uneven strand forces subject the most loaded strand to larger stress ranges under traffic and wind vibration, so it may fatigue at the anchor exit first and shift load to others in progressive deterioration; poorly seated wedges can slip.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「平行鋼絞線斜索的組成與使用應力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Make-up and service stress of parallel-strand stays\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若各股力量不均，受力最大的鋼絞線在活載與風振下承受較大應力幅，可能先在錨口疲勞斷裂，隨後負荷轉移到其他股，形成漸進劣化；錨具夾片咬合不良則可能滑移。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Uneven strand forces subject the most loaded strand to larger stress ranges under traffic and wind vibration, so it may fatigue at the anchor exit first and shift load to others in progressive deterioration.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若各股力量不均，受力最大的鋼絞線在活載與風振下承受較大應力幅，可能先在錨口疲勞斷裂，隨後負荷轉移到其他股，形成漸進劣化；錨具夾片咬合不良則可能滑移。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Uneven strand forces subject the most loaded strand to larger stress ranges under traffic and wind vibration, so it may fatigue at the anchor exit first and shift load to others in progressive deterioration; poorly seated wedges can slip. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b013-v13-13","title":"塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “2.10 m pylon piles” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"諾曼第大橋位於塞納河口，表層為軟弱沖積層，塔的巨大垂直力必須以深樁傳到下方承載層。官方技術資料列出塔基礎共 56 根直徑 2.10 m 的樁（表列 4 × 14），總長 2,828 m，深度約 40 至 55 m，每根承載約 3,000 t；南側高架橋墩另有 52 根直徑 1.50 m 的樁。塔肢分開落在兩組樁上，樁群透過厚承台把兩肢的軸力與肢底水平推力整合起來。樁群設計除了承載，還要控制兩肢之間的不均勻沉陷，因為沉陷差會使塔頂偏移並改變斜索力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The Pont de Normandie stands in the Seine estuary, where soft alluvium overlies the bearing strata, so the pylons’ large vertical forces must travel down deep piles. The official technical sheet lists 56 pylon piles of 2.10 m diameter (tabulated as 4 × 14), 2,828 m in total length, about 40 to 55 m deep and each carrying about 3,000 t; the southern viaduct piers have another 52 piles of 1.50 m. The pylon legs land on separate pile groups, and thick pile caps combine the leg axial forces with the horizontal thrust at the leg bases. Besides capacity, the groups must limit differential settlement between legs, which would tilt the pylon head and change stay forces. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “2.10 m pylon piles” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若每座塔分配 28 根樁、塔基總垂直力 60,000 t，平均每根 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t，約為單樁承載 3,000 t 的 71%；平均樁長 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m，落在 40 至 55 m 範圍內。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If each pylon has 28 piles and a total vertical force of 60,000 t, each pile averages 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t, about 71% of the 3,000 t pile capacity; average pile length is 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m, within the 40 to 55 m range.","failure":"常見誤解：「塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “2.10 m pylon piles”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-13-k1","title":"塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群","titleEn":"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary","text":"諾曼第大橋位於塞納河口，表層為軟弱沖積層，塔的巨大垂直力必須以深樁傳到下方承載層。官方技術資料列出塔基礎共 56 根直徑 2.10 m 的樁（表列 4 × 14），總長 2,828 m，深度約 40 至 55 m，每根承載約 3,000 t；南側高架橋墩另有 52 根直徑 1.50 m 的樁。","textEn":"The Pont de Normandie stands in the Seine estuary, where soft alluvium overlies the bearing strata, so the pylons’ large vertical forces must travel down deep piles. The official technical sheet lists 56 pylon piles of 2.10 m diameter (tabulated as 4 × 14), 2,828 m in total length, about 40 to 55 m deep and each carrying about 3,000 t; the southern viaduct piers have another 52 piles of 1.50 m.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary\" is correct?","options":["塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。","諾曼第大橋位於塞納河口，表層為軟弱沖積層，塔的巨大垂直力必須以深樁傳到下方承載層。","混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。"],"optionsEn":["If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter.","The Pont de Normandie stands in the Seine estuary, where soft alluvium overlies the bearing strata, so the pylons’ large vertical forces must travel down deep piles.","A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"諾曼第大橋位於塞納河口，表層為軟弱沖積層，塔的巨大垂直力必須以深樁傳到下方承載層。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The Pont de Normandie stands in the Seine estuary, where soft alluvium overlies the bearing strata, so the pylons’ large vertical forces must travel down deep piles. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b013-v13-14","title":"塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群：定量估算","titleEn":"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “2.10 m pylon piles” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若每座塔分配 28 根樁、塔基總垂直力 60,000 t，平均每根 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t，約為單樁承載 3,000 t 的 71%；平均樁長 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m，落在 40 至 55 m 範圍內。總垂直力與每塔樁數分配為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If each pylon has 28 piles and a total vertical force of 60,000 t, each pile averages 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t, about 71% of the 3,000 t pile capacity; average pile length is 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m, within the 40 to 55 m range. Total force and piles per pylon are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以試樁載重試驗確認單樁承載與沉陷，施工時記錄每根樁的鑽掘深度、地層、混凝土灌注量與完整性檢測；塔施工期間量測兩肢基礎的沉陷差，並與設計預測比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Confirm single-pile capacity and settlement by load tests on trial piles, record each pile’s drilled depth, strata, concrete volume and integrity test during construction, and measure differential settlement between the two leg foundations as the pylon rises, comparing with design predictions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若每座塔分配 28 根樁、塔基總垂直力 60,000 t，平均每根 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t，約為單樁承載 3,000 t 的 71%；平均樁長 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m，落在 40 至 55 m 範圍內。總垂直力與每塔樁數分配為教學假設。","textEn":"If each pylon has 28 piles and a total vertical force of 60,000 t, each pile averages 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t, about 71% of the 3,000 t pile capacity; average pile length is 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m, within the 40 to 55 m range. Total force and piles per pylon are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary\", which statement holds?","options":["只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。","斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。","若每座塔分配 28 根樁、塔基總垂直力 60,000 t，平均每根 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t，約為單樁承載 3,000 t 的 71%。"],"optionsEn":["Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge.","With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.","If each pylon has 28 piles and a total vertical force of 60,000 t, each pile averages 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t, about 71% of the 3,000 t pile capacity."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若每座塔分配 28 根樁、塔基總垂直力 60,000 t，平均每根 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t，約為單樁承載 3,000 t 的 71%；平均樁長 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m，落在 40 至 55 m 範圍內。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If each pylon has 28 piles and a total vertical force of 60,000 t, each pile averages 60,000/28 ≈ 2,143 t, about 71% of the 3,000 t pile capacity; average pile length is 2,828/56 ≈ 50.5 m, within the 40 to 55 m range. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b013-v13-15","title":"塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “2.10 m pylon piles” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以試樁載重試驗確認單樁承載與沉陷，施工時記錄每根樁的鑽掘深度、地層、混凝土灌注量與完整性檢測；塔施工期間量測兩肢基礎的沉陷差，並與設計預測比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Confirm single-pile capacity and settlement by load tests on trial piles, record each pile’s drilled depth, strata, concrete volume and integrity test during construction, and measure differential settlement between the two leg foundations as the pylon rises, comparing with design predictions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：樁基施工紀錄應逐根保存並與地層剖面對照，異常樁由設計者評估是否補樁；塔施工期間把兩肢沉陷差列為定期量測項目並設定警戒值。","observationEn":"Site practice: Keep pile records individually and compare with the ground profile, with the designer deciding on extra piles for anomalous ones; make differential settlement between legs a routine measurement with an alert value during pylon construction.","failure":"注意干擾：若某一肢下方地層較差或樁底清孔不足，兩肢沉陷差使塔頂向一側偏移，斜索力分配隨之改變；河口沖刷若降低樁頂附近的土壤圍束，樁的側向勁度也會下降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A weaker stratum or poorly cleaned pile bases under one leg cause differential settlement that tilts the pylon head and redistributes stay forces; estuary scour that reduces soil confinement near pile heads also lowers lateral stiffness. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以試樁載重試驗確認單樁承載與沉陷，施工時記錄每根樁的鑽掘深度、地層、混凝土灌注量與完整性檢測；塔施工期間量測兩肢基礎的沉陷差，並與設計預測比較。","textEn":"Confirm single-pile capacity and settlement by load tests on trial piles, record each pile’s drilled depth, strata, concrete volume and integrity test during construction, and measure differential settlement between the two leg foundations as the pylon rises, comparing with design predictions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"樁基施工紀錄應逐根保存並與地層剖面對照，異常樁由設計者評估是否補樁；塔施工期間把兩肢沉陷差列為定期量測項目並設定警戒值。","textEn":"Keep pile records individually and compare with the ground profile, with the designer deciding on extra piles for anomalous ones; make differential settlement between legs a routine measurement with an alert value during pylon construction.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary\"?","options":["以試樁載重試驗確認單樁承載與沉陷，施工時記錄每根樁的鑽掘深度、地層、混凝土灌注量與完整性檢測；塔施工期間量測兩肢基礎的沉陷差，並與設計預測比較。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["Confirm single-pile capacity and settlement by load tests on trial piles, record each pile’s drilled depth, strata, concrete volume and integrity test during construction, and measure differential settlement between the two leg foundations as the pylon rises, comparing with design predictions.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以試樁載重試驗確認單樁承載與沉陷，施工時記錄每根樁的鑽掘深度、地層、混凝土灌注量與完整性檢測；塔施工期間量測兩肢基礎的沉陷差，並與設計預測比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Confirm single-pile capacity and settlement by load tests on trial piles, record each pile’s drilled depth, strata, concrete volume and integrity test during construction, and measure differential settlement between the two leg foundations as the pylon rises, comparing with design predictions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b013-v13-16","title":"塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「塔基 2.10 m 樁群」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “2.10 m pylon piles” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若某一肢下方地層較差或樁底清孔不足，兩肢沉陷差使塔頂向一側偏移，斜索力分配隨之改變；河口沖刷若降低樁頂附近的土壤圍束，樁的側向勁度也會下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A weaker stratum or poorly cleaned pile bases under one leg cause differential settlement that tilts the pylon head and redistributes stay forces; estuary scour that reduces soil confinement near pile heads also lowers lateral stiffness. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：樁群設計除了承載，還要控制兩肢之間的不均勻沉陷，因為沉陷差會使塔頂偏移並改變斜索力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Besides capacity, the groups must limit differential settlement between legs, which would tilt the pylon head and change stay forces.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若某一肢下方地層較差或樁底清孔不足，兩肢沉陷差使塔頂向一側偏移，斜索力分配隨之改變；河口沖刷若降低樁頂附近的土壤圍束，樁的側向勁度也會下降。","textEn":"A weaker stratum or poorly cleaned pile bases under one leg cause differential settlement that tilts the pylon head and redistributes stay forces; estuary scour that reduces soil confinement near pile heads also lowers lateral stiffness.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「塞納河口軟弱地層上的塔基樁群」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pylon pile groups in the soft Seine estuary\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若某一肢下方地層較差或樁底清孔不足，兩肢沉陷差使塔頂向一側偏移，斜索力分配隨之改變；河口沖刷若降低樁頂附近的土壤圍束，樁的側向勁度也會下降。","混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A weaker stratum or poorly cleaned pile bases under one leg cause differential settlement that tilts the pylon head and redistributes stay forces.","A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若某一肢下方地層較差或樁底清孔不足，兩肢沉陷差使塔頂向一側偏移，斜索力分配隨之改變；河口沖刷若降低樁頂附近的土壤圍束，樁的側向勁度也會下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A weaker stratum or poorly cleaned pile bases under one leg cause differential settlement that tilts the pylon head and redistributes stay forces; estuary scour that reduces soil confinement near pile heads also lowers lateral stiffness. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b013-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱」與「鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones\" and \"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b013-v13-17","title":"混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「近塔混凝土懸臂」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"主跨兩端的混凝土段由塔向河側伸出約 116 m，向岸側伸出約 96 m，以平衡懸臂方式逐節施作並逐對安裝斜索。混凝土懸臂在施工中持續承受自重與斜索力，彈性變形之外還有收縮與徐變，數年內會繼續下垂或上拱，影響後續鋼梁段的對接高程與完工線形。因此每一節段的模板都要設定預拱值，包含彈性撓度、徐變與收縮的預測，以及後續鋼梁、鋪面荷載造成的變形，讓最終線形符合設計。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「近塔混凝土懸臂」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The concrete zones at each end of the main span extend about 116 m from the pylon toward the river and about 96 m toward the shore, built by balanced cantilever segment by segment with stays installed in pairs. The concrete cantilever carries self-weight and stay forces throughout construction, and beyond elastic deformation it shrinks and creeps, continuing to sag or rise for years and affecting the connection level of the steel segments and the final profile. Each segment’s formwork is therefore set to a camber that includes predicted elastic deflection, creep and shrinkage and the deformation from later steel and surfacing loads, so that the final profile matches the design. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：預拱 = 彈性撓度 × (1 + φ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Camber = elastic deflection × (1 + φ).","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「近塔混凝土懸臂」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-17-k1","title":"混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱","titleEn":"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones","text":"主跨兩端的混凝土段由塔向河側伸出約 116 m，向岸側伸出約 96 m，以平衡懸臂方式逐節施作並逐對安裝斜索。混凝土懸臂在施工中持續承受自重與斜索力，彈性變形之外還有收縮與徐變，數年內會繼續下垂或上拱，影響後續鋼梁段的對接高程與完工線形。","textEn":"The concrete zones at each end of the main span extend about 116 m from the pylon toward the river and about 96 m toward the shore, built by balanced cantilever segment by segment with stays installed in pairs. The concrete cantilever carries self-weight and stay forces throughout construction, and beyond elastic deformation it shrinks and creeps, continuing to sag or rise for years and affecting the connection level of the steel segments and the final profile.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones\" is correct?","options":["混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。","斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","主跨兩端的混凝土段由塔向河側伸出約 116 m，向岸側伸出約 96 m，以平衡懸臂方式逐節施作並逐對安裝斜索。"],"optionsEn":["A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered.","Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","The concrete zones at each end of the main span extend about 116 m from the pylon toward the river and about 96 m toward the shore, built by balanced cantilever segment by segment with stays installed in pairs."],"answer":2,"explanation":"主跨兩端的混凝土段由塔向河側伸出約 116 m，向岸側伸出約 96 m，以平衡懸臂方式逐節施作並逐對安裝斜索。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The concrete zones at each end of the main span extend about 116 m from the pylon toward the river and about 96 m toward the shore, built by balanced cantilever segment by segment with stays installed in pairs. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b013-v13-18","title":"混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱：定量估算","titleEn":"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「近塔混凝土懸臂」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：預拱 = 彈性撓度 × (1 + φ)。若某節段在後續施工荷載下的彈性撓度為 60 mm、徐變係數 φ = 2.0，徐變附加 60×2.0 = 120 mm，總預拱約 180 mm；若 φ 只取 1.0，預拱 120 mm，完工後將低於設計線約 60 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Camber = elastic deflection × (1 + φ). For a segment with 60 mm elastic deflection under later loads and a creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep adds 60×2.0 = 120 mm for a total camber of about 180 mm; using φ = 1.0 gives 120 mm and leaves the finished deck about 60 mm below the design line. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以實際混凝土的齡期、彈性模數與徐變試驗修正時間相依分析，每節段澆置前後與斜索張拉後量測懸臂端高程；預測與實測偏差超過容許時，調整後續節段的模板預拱或斜索力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Update the time-dependent analysis with the actual concrete age, modulus and creep tests, and survey cantilever-tip levels before and after each pour and after each stay is stressed; when predicted and measured levels diverge beyond tolerance, adjust the camber of later segments or the stay forces.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"預拱 = 彈性撓度 × (1 + φ)。若某節段在後續施工荷載下的彈性撓度為 60 mm、徐變係數 φ = 2.0，徐變附加 60×2.0 = 120 mm，總預拱約 180 mm；若 φ 只取 1.0，預拱 120 mm，完工後將低於設計線約 60 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Camber = elastic deflection × (1 + φ). For a segment with 60 mm elastic deflection under later loads and a creep coefficient φ = 2.0, creep adds 60×2.0 = 120 mm for a total camber of about 180 mm; using φ = 1.0 gives 120 mm and leaves the finished deck about 60 mm below the design line. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones\", which statement holds?","options":["預拱 = 彈性撓度 × (1 + φ)。","斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。","斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。"],"optionsEn":["Camber = elastic deflection × (1 + φ).","Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life.","A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"預拱 = 彈性撓度 × (1 + φ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Camber = elastic deflection × (1 + φ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b013-v13-19","title":"混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「近塔混凝土懸臂」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以實際混凝土的齡期、彈性模數與徐變試驗修正時間相依分析，每節段澆置前後與斜索張拉後量測懸臂端高程；預測與實測偏差超過容許時，調整後續節段的模板預拱或斜索力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Update the time-dependent analysis with the actual concrete age, modulus and creep tests, and survey cantilever-tip levels before and after each pour and after each stay is stressed; when predicted and measured levels diverge beyond tolerance, adjust the camber of later segments or the stay forces. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：每節段的預拱表要列出各項組成並由施工控制工程師簽認，量測固定在清晨溫度均勻時進行；混凝土配比或養護條件改變時，須重新試驗彈性模數與徐變。","observationEn":"Site practice: Each segment’s camber table should list its components and be signed by the construction-control engineer, with surveys fixed at dawn when temperature is uniform; any change in mix or curing requires new modulus and creep tests.","failure":"注意干擾：若徐變參數估計錯誤，混凝土懸臂端與後續鋼梁的對接高程出現誤差，需強制頂壓或加配重才能對接；完工後線形持續變化，可能造成伸縮縫與鋪面異常。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Wrong creep parameters leave a level mismatch between the concrete cantilever tip and the following steel segments that must be forced together by jacking or ballast; a profile that keeps changing after completion can distress joints and surfacing. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以實際混凝土的齡期、彈性模數與徐變試驗修正時間相依分析，每節段澆置前後與斜索張拉後量測懸臂端高程；預測與實測偏差超過容許時，調整後續節段的模板預拱或斜索力。","textEn":"Update the time-dependent analysis with the actual concrete age, modulus and creep tests, and survey cantilever-tip levels before and after each pour and after each stay is stressed; when predicted and measured levels diverge beyond tolerance, adjust the camber of later segments or the stay forces.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"每節段的預拱表要列出各項組成並由施工控制工程師簽認，量測固定在清晨溫度均勻時進行；混凝土配比或養護條件改變時，須重新試驗彈性模數與徐變。","textEn":"Each segment’s camber table should list its components and be signed by the construction-control engineer, with surveys fixed at dawn when temperature is uniform; any change in mix or curing requires new modulus and creep tests.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以實際混凝土的齡期、彈性模數與徐變試驗修正時間相依分析，每節段澆置前後與斜索張拉後量測懸臂端高程；預測與實測偏差超過容許時，調整後續節段的模板預拱或斜索力。","塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Update the time-dependent analysis with the actual concrete age, modulus and creep tests, and survey cantilever-tip levels before and after each pour and after each stay is stressed.","Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以實際混凝土的齡期、彈性模數與徐變試驗修正時間相依分析，每節段澆置前後與斜索張拉後量測懸臂端高程；預測與實測偏差超過容許時，調整後續節段的模板預拱或斜索力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Update the time-dependent analysis with the actual concrete age, modulus and creep tests, and survey cantilever-tip levels before and after each pour and after each stay is stressed; when predicted and measured levels diverge beyond tolerance, adjust the camber of later segments or the stay forces. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b013-v13-20","title":"混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱：失效診斷","titleEn":"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「近塔混凝土懸臂」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete cantilevers near the pylons” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若徐變參數估計錯誤，混凝土懸臂端與後續鋼梁的對接高程出現誤差，需強制頂壓或加配重才能對接；完工後線形持續變化，可能造成伸縮縫與鋪面異常。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Wrong creep parameters leave a level mismatch between the concrete cantilever tip and the following steel segments that must be forced together by jacking or ballast; a profile that keeps changing after completion can distress joints and surfacing. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：因此每一節段的模板都要設定預拱值，包含彈性撓度、徐變與收縮的預測，以及後續鋼梁、鋪面荷載造成的變形，讓最終線形符合設計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Each segment’s formwork is therefore set to a camber that includes predicted elastic deflection, creep and shrinkage and the deformation from later steel and surfacing loads, so that the final profile matches the design.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若徐變參數估計錯誤，混凝土懸臂端與後續鋼梁的對接高程出現誤差，需強制頂壓或加配重才能對接；完工後線形持續變化，可能造成伸縮縫與鋪面異常。","textEn":"Wrong creep parameters leave a level mismatch between the concrete cantilever tip and the following steel segments that must be forced together by jacking or ballast; a profile that keeps changing after completion can distress joints and surfacing.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「混凝土段的平衡懸臂施工與預拱」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Balanced cantilever construction and camber of the concrete zones\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","若徐變參數估計錯誤，混凝土懸臂端與後續鋼梁的對接高程出現誤差，需強制頂壓或加配重才能對接；完工後線形持續變化，可能造成伸縮縫與鋪面異常。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","Wrong creep parameters leave a level mismatch between the concrete cantilever tip and the following steel segments that must be forced together by jacking or ballast."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若徐變參數估計錯誤，混凝土懸臂端與後續鋼梁的對接高程出現誤差，需強制頂壓或加配重才能對接；完工後線形持續變化，可能造成伸縮縫與鋪面異常。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Wrong creep parameters leave a level mismatch between the concrete cantilever tip and the following steel segments that must be forced together by jacking or ballast; a profile that keeps changing after completion can distress joints and surfacing. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b013-v13-21","title":"鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「19.65 m 鋼節段」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “19.65 m steel segments” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"中央 624 m 鋼梁由 32 個長約 19.65 m 的標準節段加上中央合龍段組成，官方資料列出鋼橋面約 5,600 t、平均每節約 180 t。每個鋼節段吊上懸臂端後先與前一節焊接，再安裝並張拉對應的一對斜索。合龍前，每座塔的懸臂已伸到主跨一半約 428 m，是當時前所未見的長度：懸臂端在新節段吊掛、斜索尚未張拉時會明顯下沉，在風中也會側向擺動。合龍段必須在兩個懸臂端高程、軸線與溫度都吻合的時段放入，並先以臨時連接鎖定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「19.65 m 鋼節段」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The central 624 m steel girder comprises 32 standard segments about 19.65 m long plus a central closure segment; the official sheet gives about 5,600 t of steel deck, about 180 t per segment on average. Each steel segment lifted to the cantilever tip is welded to the previous one before its pair of stays is installed and stressed. Before closure each pylon’s cantilever had reached half the main span, about 428 m, an unprecedented length: the tip drops noticeably while a new segment hangs before its stays are stressed, and it sways sideways in wind. The closure segment must go in when the two tips match in level, alignment and temperature, and be locked first with temporary connections. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “19.65 m steel segments” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：180 t 節段約 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN，若斜索張拉前懸臂端的等效勁度 k = 1,500 kN/m，吊掛時懸臂端下沉 δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m；斜索張拉後應恢復到預定高程。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 180 t segment weighs about 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN; with an equivalent tip stiffness k = 1,500 kN/m before its stays are stressed, the tip drops δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m while the segment hangs, to be recovered by stressing.","failure":"常見誤解：「斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「19.65 m 鋼節段」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “19.65 m steel segments”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-21-k1","title":"鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍","titleEn":"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers","text":"中央 624 m 鋼梁由 32 個長約 19.65 m 的標準節段加上中央合龍段組成，官方資料列出鋼橋面約 5,600 t、平均每節約 180 t。每個鋼節段吊上懸臂端後先與前一節焊接，再安裝並張拉對應的一對斜索。","textEn":"The central 624 m steel girder comprises 32 standard segments about 19.65 m long plus a central closure segment; the official sheet gives about 5,600 t of steel deck, about 180 t per segment on average. Each steel segment lifted to the cantilever tip is welded to the previous one before its pair of stays is installed and stressed.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers\" is correct?","options":["中央 624 m 鋼梁由 32 個長約 19.65 m 的標準節段加上中央合龍段組成，官方資料列出鋼橋面約 5,600 t、平均每節約 180 t。","斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。"],"optionsEn":["The central 624 m steel girder comprises 32 standard segments about 19.65 m long plus a central closure segment.","Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"中央 624 m 鋼梁由 32 個長約 19.65 m 的標準節段加上中央合龍段組成，官方資料列出鋼橋面約 5,600 t、平均每節約 180 t。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The central 624 m steel girder comprises 32 standard segments about 19.65 m long plus a central closure segment; the official sheet gives about 5,600 t of steel deck, about 180 t per segment on average. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b013-v13-22","title":"鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍：定量估算","titleEn":"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「19.65 m 鋼節段」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “19.65 m steel segments” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：180 t 節段約 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN，若斜索張拉前懸臂端的等效勁度 k = 1,500 kN/m，吊掛時懸臂端下沉 δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m；斜索張拉後應恢復到預定高程。若 k 提高到 2,500 kN/m，δ 約 0.71 m。勁度為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 180 t segment weighs about 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN; with an equivalent tip stiffness k = 1,500 kN/m before its stays are stressed, the tip drops δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m while the segment hangs, to be recovered by stressing. At k = 2,500 kN/m, δ is about 0.71 m. Stiffness is a teaching assumption. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每節段吊裝前後、焊接後與斜索張拉後都量測懸臂端高程與軸線，與施工控制模型逐步比對；合龍前連續記錄兩懸臂端的相對高差、間距、溫度與風速，選定合龍時段並以臨時鎖定裝置固定後再焊接。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Survey tip level and alignment before and after each lift, after welding and after stressing, comparing step by step with the construction-control model; before closure continuously record the relative level, gap, temperature and wind at the two tips, choose the closure window and fix the segment with temporary locks before welding.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"180 t 節段約 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN，若斜索張拉前懸臂端的等效勁度 k = 1,500 kN/m，吊掛時懸臂端下沉 δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m；斜索張拉後應恢復到預定高程。若 k 提高到 2,500 kN/m，δ 約 0.71 m。勁度為教學假設。","textEn":"A 180 t segment weighs about 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN; with an equivalent tip stiffness k = 1,500 kN/m before its stays are stressed, the tip drops δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m while the segment hangs, to be recovered by stressing. At k = 2,500 kN/m, δ is about 0.71 m. Stiffness is a teaching assumption.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers\", which statement holds?","options":["斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。","180 t 節段約 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN，若斜索張拉前懸臂端的等效勁度 k = 1,500 kN/m，吊掛時懸臂端下沉 δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m。","大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.","A 180 t segment weighs about 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN.","An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight."],"answer":1,"explanation":"180 t 節段約 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN，若斜索張拉前懸臂端的等效勁度 k = 1,500 kN/m，吊掛時懸臂端下沉 δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m；斜索張拉後應恢復到預定高程。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 180 t segment weighs about 180×9.81 ≈ 1,766 kN; with an equivalent tip stiffness k = 1,500 kN/m before its stays are stressed, the tip drops δ = 1,766/1,500 ≈ 1.18 m while the segment hangs, to be recovered by stressing. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b013-v13-23","title":"鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「19.65 m 鋼節段」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “19.65 m steel segments” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每節段吊裝前後、焊接後與斜索張拉後都量測懸臂端高程與軸線，與施工控制模型逐步比對；合龍前連續記錄兩懸臂端的相對高差、間距、溫度與風速，選定合龍時段並以臨時鎖定裝置固定後再焊接。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Survey tip level and alignment before and after each lift, after welding and after stressing, comparing step by step with the construction-control model; before closure continuously record the relative level, gap, temperature and wind at the two tips, choose the closure window and fix the segment with temporary locks before welding. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：鋼節段的施工控制表要列出每一步的目標高程、容許偏差與對應的斜索張拉力，並規定量測時段與停工風速；合龍作業以停留檢查點管理，由設計與施工控制工程師共同簽認。","observationEn":"Site practice: The steel-segment control table should list target levels, tolerances and stay forces for every step, with survey times and stop-work wind speeds; closure is managed as a hold point signed jointly by the designer and construction-control engineer.","failure":"注意干擾：若吊裝時懸臂端下沉超過預期而急於焊接，節段會以錯誤高程固定，後續斜索力需大幅調整；超長懸臂在強風中缺乏臨時抗風措施，側向擺動可能使吊具與節段碰撞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Welding in a hurry while the tip has dropped more than expected fixes the segment at the wrong level and forces large later stay adjustments; an extremely long cantilever without temporary wind measures can sway enough in strong wind for rigging and segments to collide. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每節段吊裝前後、焊接後與斜索張拉後都量測懸臂端高程與軸線，與施工控制模型逐步比對；合龍前連續記錄兩懸臂端的相對高差、間距、溫度與風速，選定合龍時段並以臨時鎖定裝置固定後再焊接。","textEn":"Survey tip level and alignment before and after each lift, after welding and after stressing, comparing step by step with the construction-control model; before closure continuously record the relative level, gap, temperature and wind at the two tips, choose the closure window and fix the segment with temporary locks before welding.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"鋼節段的施工控制表要列出每一步的目標高程、容許偏差與對應的斜索張拉力，並規定量測時段與停工風速；合龍作業以停留檢查點管理，由設計與施工控制工程師共同簽認。","textEn":"The steel-segment control table should list target levels, tolerances and stay forces for every step, with survey times and stop-work wind speeds; closure is managed as a hold point signed jointly by the designer and construction-control engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。","每節段吊裝前後、焊接後與斜索張拉後都量測懸臂端高程與軸線，與施工控制模型逐步比對。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.","Survey tip level and alignment before and after each lift, after welding and after stressing, comparing step by step with the construction-control model."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每節段吊裝前後、焊接後與斜索張拉後都量測懸臂端高程與軸線，與施工控制模型逐步比對；合龍前連續記錄兩懸臂端的相對高差、間距、溫度與風速，選定合龍時段並以臨時鎖定裝置固定後再焊接。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Survey tip level and alignment before and after each lift, after welding and after stressing, comparing step by step with the construction-control model; before closure continuously record the relative level, gap, temperature and wind at the two tips, choose the closure window and fix the segment with temporary locks before welding. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b013-v13-24","title":"鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍：失效診斷","titleEn":"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「19.65 m 鋼節段」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “19.65 m steel segments” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若吊裝時懸臂端下沉超過預期而急於焊接，節段會以錯誤高程固定，後續斜索力需大幅調整；超長懸臂在強風中缺乏臨時抗風措施，側向擺動可能使吊具與節段碰撞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Welding in a hurry while the tip has dropped more than expected fixes the segment at the wrong level and forces large later stay adjustments; an extremely long cantilever without temporary wind measures can sway enough in strong wind for rigging and segments to collide. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：合龍段必須在兩個懸臂端高程、軸線與溫度都吻合的時段放入，並先以臨時連接鎖定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The closure segment must go in when the two tips match in level, alignment and temperature, and be locked first with temporary connections.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若吊裝時懸臂端下沉超過預期而急於焊接，節段會以錯誤高程固定，後續斜索力需大幅調整；超長懸臂在強風中缺乏臨時抗風措施，側向擺動可能使吊具與節段碰撞。","textEn":"Welding in a hurry while the tip has dropped more than expected fixes the segment at the wrong level and forces large later stay adjustments; an extremely long cantilever without temporary wind measures can sway enough in strong wind for rigging and segments to collide.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鋼節段吊裝與 428 m 懸臂的合龍」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Steel segment lifting and closing 428 m cantilevers\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若吊裝時懸臂端下沉超過預期而急於焊接，節段會以錯誤高程固定，後續斜索力需大幅調整；超長懸臂在強風中缺乏臨時抗風措施，側向擺動可能使吊具與節段碰撞。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。"],"optionsEn":["Welding in a hurry while the tip has dropped more than expected fixes the segment at the wrong level and forces large later stay adjustments.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若吊裝時懸臂端下沉超過預期而急於焊接，節段會以錯誤高程固定，後續斜索力需大幅調整；超長懸臂在強風中缺乏臨時抗風措施，側向擺動可能使吊具與節段碰撞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Welding in a hurry while the tip has dropped more than expected fixes the segment at the wrong level and forces large later stay adjustments; an extremely long cantilever without temporary wind measures can sway enough in strong wind for rigging and segments to collide. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b013-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數」與「通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors\" and \"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b013-v13-25","title":"現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「現地風場量測」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “On-site wind measurement” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"法國建築科學技術中心（CSTB）為諾曼第大橋量測了橋址風況並模擬結構的氣動行為。河口開闊、靠近海岸，風速高且紊流明顯；設計時不能只看平均風速，還要知道紊流強度與陣風的空間相關性，因為細長的主梁與長索對短時間的陣風與紊流擾動（抖振）都會反應。現地量測提供平均風速剖面、紊流強度與頻譜，作為風洞試驗流場與抖振分析的輸入；施工期最長懸臂的抗風安全，也依這些統計判斷作業與停工的門檻。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「現地風場量測」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"France’s building science centre CSTB measured the wind at the Pont de Normandie site and simulated the structure’s aerodynamic behaviour. The open estuary near the coast brings high winds with marked turbulence; design cannot look only at mean wind speed but must know turbulence intensity and the spatial correlation of gusts, because a slender deck and long stays respond to short gusts and turbulent buffeting. Site measurements provide the mean wind profile, turbulence intensity and spectra used as inputs to wind-tunnel flow and buffeting analysis, and the same statistics set working and stop-work limits for the longest construction cantilever. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “On-site wind measurement” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：紊流強度 I_u = σ_u/U。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Turbulence intensity I_u = σ_u/U.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「現地風場量測」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “On-site wind measurement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-25-k1","title":"現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數","titleEn":"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors","text":"法國建築科學技術中心（CSTB）為諾曼第大橋量測了橋址風況並模擬結構的氣動行為。河口開闊、靠近海岸，風速高且紊流明顯；設計時不能只看平均風速，還要知道紊流強度與陣風的空間相關性，因為細長的主梁與長索對短時間的陣風與紊流擾動（抖振）都會反應。","textEn":"France’s building science centre CSTB measured the wind at the Pont de Normandie site and simulated the structure’s aerodynamic behaviour. The open estuary near the coast brings high winds with marked turbulence; design cannot look only at mean wind speed but must know turbulence intensity and the spatial correlation of gusts, because a slender deck and long stays respond to short gusts and turbulent buffeting.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors\" is correct?","options":["只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。","法國建築科學技術中心（CSTB）為諾曼第大橋量測了橋址風況並模擬結構的氣動行為。","斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。"],"optionsEn":["Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge.","France’s building science centre CSTB measured the wind at the Pont de Normandie site and simulated the structure’s aerodynamic behaviour.","Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life."],"answer":1,"explanation":"法國建築科學技術中心（CSTB）為諾曼第大橋量測了橋址風況並模擬結構的氣動行為。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"France’s building science centre CSTB measured the wind at the Pont de Normandie site and simulated the structure’s aerodynamic behaviour. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b013-v13-26","title":"現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數：定量估算","titleEn":"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「現地風場量測」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “On-site wind measurement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：紊流強度 I_u = σ_u/U。若 10 分鐘平均 U = 32 m/s、標準差 σ_u = 4.8 m/s，I_u = 0.15；以峰值因子 g = 3.5 估算陣風風壓係數 (1 + g·I_u)² = (1 + 3.5×0.15)² ≈ 2.33，即陣風峰值風壓約為平均風壓的 2.3 倍。風速數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Turbulence intensity I_u = σ_u/U. With a 10-minute mean U = 32 m/s and standard deviation σ_u = 4.8 m/s, I_u = 0.15; with a peak factor g = 3.5, the gust pressure factor is (1 + g·I_u)² = (1 + 3.5×0.15)² ≈ 2.33, so peak gust pressure is about 2.3 times the mean pressure. Wind values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在橋址設置不同高度的超音波風速計長期記錄，計算平均風速、紊流強度、積分尺度與頻譜，與風洞流場模擬比較；施工期以懸臂端的風速計與加速度計同步記錄，驗證抖振反應與分析預測的量級。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Install ultrasonic anemometers at several heights at the site for long-term records, computing mean speed, turbulence intensity, integral scales and spectra for comparison with the wind-tunnel flow; during construction log anemometers and accelerometers at the cantilever tip together to confirm the order of buffeting response against predictions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"紊流強度 I_u = σ_u/U。若 10 分鐘平均 U = 32 m/s、標準差 σ_u = 4.8 m/s，I_u = 0.15；以峰值因子 g = 3.5 估算陣風風壓係數 (1 + g·I_u)² = (1 + 3.5×0.15)² ≈ 2.33，即陣風峰值風壓約為平均風壓的 2.3 倍。風速數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Turbulence intensity I_u = σ_u/U. With a 10-minute mean U = 32 m/s and standard deviation σ_u = 4.8 m/s, I_u = 0.15; with a peak factor g = 3.5, the gust pressure factor is (1 + g·I_u)² = (1 + 3.5×0.15)² ≈ 2.33, so peak gust pressure is about 2.3 times the mean pressure. Wind values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors\", which statement holds?","options":["斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。","塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。","紊流強度 I_u = σ_u/U。"],"optionsEn":["A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed.","Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance.","Turbulence intensity I_u = σ_u/U."],"answer":2,"explanation":"紊流強度 I_u = σ_u/U。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Turbulence intensity I_u = σ_u/U. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b013-v13-27","title":"現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「現地風場量測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “On-site wind measurement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在橋址設置不同高度的超音波風速計長期記錄，計算平均風速、紊流強度、積分尺度與頻譜，與風洞流場模擬比較；施工期以懸臂端的風速計與加速度計同步記錄，驗證抖振反應與分析預測的量級。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Install ultrasonic anemometers at several heights at the site for long-term records, computing mean speed, turbulence intensity, integral scales and spectra for comparison with the wind-tunnel flow; during construction log anemometers and accelerometers at the cantilever tip together to confirm the order of buffeting response against predictions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：風量測計畫要規定儀器高度、遮蔽距離、取樣率與資料保存，並在設計開始前累積足夠長的紀錄；施工期的停工風速應以陣風而非平均風速表示，並由現場風速計即時通報。","observationEn":"Site practice: The wind measurement plan should fix instrument heights, clearance from obstructions, sampling rate and data retention, with records long enough before design starts; construction stop-work limits should be expressed as gust rather than mean speeds and reported live from site anemometers.","failure":"注意干擾：若以平滑流風洞試驗代替紊流場，抖振反應會被低估，施工中的大懸臂在中等風速下就出現超出預期的擺動；風速計安裝在受結構遮蔽的位置，則量測值偏低而誤導作業決策。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Testing in smooth flow instead of turbulent flow underestimates buffeting, so the long construction cantilever sways more than expected at moderate wind; anemometers placed in the structure’s wind shadow read low and mislead site decisions. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在橋址設置不同高度的超音波風速計長期記錄，計算平均風速、紊流強度、積分尺度與頻譜，與風洞流場模擬比較；施工期以懸臂端的風速計與加速度計同步記錄，驗證抖振反應與分析預測的量級。","textEn":"Install ultrasonic anemometers at several heights at the site for long-term records, computing mean speed, turbulence intensity, integral scales and spectra for comparison with the wind-tunnel flow; during construction log anemometers and accelerometers at the cantilever tip together to confirm the order of buffeting response against predictions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"風量測計畫要規定儀器高度、遮蔽距離、取樣率與資料保存，並在設計開始前累積足夠長的紀錄；施工期的停工風速應以陣風而非平均風速表示，並由現場風速計即時通報。","textEn":"The wind measurement plan should fix instrument heights, clearance from obstructions, sampling rate and data retention, with records long enough before design starts; construction stop-work limits should be expressed as gust rather than mean speeds and reported live from site anemometers.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors\"?","options":["在橋址設置不同高度的超音波風速計長期記錄，計算平均風速、紊流強度、積分尺度與頻譜，與風洞流場模擬比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Install ultrasonic anemometers at several heights at the site for long-term records, computing mean speed, turbulence intensity, integral scales and spectra for comparison with the wind-tunnel flow.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在橋址設置不同高度的超音波風速計長期記錄，計算平均風速、紊流強度、積分尺度與頻譜，與風洞流場模擬比較；施工期以懸臂端的風速計與加速度計同步記錄，驗證抖振反應與分析預測的量級。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Install ultrasonic anemometers at several heights at the site for long-term records, computing mean speed, turbulence intensity, integral scales and spectra for comparison with the wind-tunnel flow; during construction log anemometers and accelerometers at the cantilever tip together to confirm the order of buffeting response against predictions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b013-v13-28","title":"現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數：失效診斷","titleEn":"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「現地風場量測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “On-site wind measurement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若以平滑流風洞試驗代替紊流場，抖振反應會被低估，施工中的大懸臂在中等風速下就出現超出預期的擺動；風速計安裝在受結構遮蔽的位置，則量測值偏低而誤導作業決策。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Testing in smooth flow instead of turbulent flow underestimates buffeting, so the long construction cantilever sways more than expected at moderate wind; anemometers placed in the structure’s wind shadow read low and mislead site decisions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：現地量測提供平均風速剖面、紊流強度與頻譜，作為風洞試驗流場與抖振分析的輸入；施工期最長懸臂的抗風安全，也依這些統計判斷作業與停工的門檻。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Site measurements provide the mean wind profile, turbulence intensity and spectra used as inputs to wind-tunnel flow and buffeting analysis, and the same statistics set working and stop-work limits for the longest construction cantilever.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若以平滑流風洞試驗代替紊流場，抖振反應會被低估，施工中的大懸臂在中等風速下就出現超出預期的擺動；風速計安裝在受結構遮蔽的位置，則量測值偏低而誤導作業決策。","textEn":"Testing in smooth flow instead of turbulent flow underestimates buffeting, so the long construction cantilever sways more than expected at moderate wind; anemometers placed in the structure’s wind shadow read low and mislead site decisions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「現地風量測、紊流與陣風係數」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Site wind measurement, turbulence and gust factors\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若以平滑流風洞試驗代替紊流場，抖振反應會被低估，施工中的大懸臂在中等風速下就出現超出預期的擺動；風速計安裝在受結構遮蔽的位置，則量測值偏低而誤導作業決策。","斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Testing in smooth flow instead of turbulent flow underestimates buffeting, so the long construction cantilever sways more than expected at moderate wind.","Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若以平滑流風洞試驗代替紊流場，抖振反應會被低估，施工中的大懸臂在中等風速下就出現超出預期的擺動；風速計安裝在受結構遮蔽的位置，則量測值偏低而誤導作業決策。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Testing in smooth flow instead of turbulent flow underestimates buffeting, so the long construction cantilever sways more than expected at moderate wind; anemometers placed in the structure’s wind shadow read low and mislead site decisions. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b013-v13-29","title":"通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「長索阻尼器」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Long-stay dampers” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"諾曼第大橋通車不久，最長的斜索出現過大的振動，管理單位隨即加裝了多套阻尼系統。長索的固有阻尼非常小（往往只有千分之幾），風雨、渦流或橋面運動只要提供少量能量，振幅就會累積到肉眼可見。加裝在橋面附近的外置阻尼器把索的振動能量轉成熱，可達到的最大附加阻尼大約與阻尼器到錨點距離佔索長的比例成正比，所以阻尼器位置受橋面空間限制時，效果有上限。這次經驗也讓後來的斜張橋在設計階段就預留阻尼器與防振措施。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「長索阻尼器」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Shortly after the Pont de Normandie opened, its longest stays showed excessive vibration, and several damping systems were quickly retrofitted. The inherent damping of long stays is very small, often only a few thousandths, so a little energy from wind and rain, vortices or deck motion can build amplitudes visible to the eye. External dampers near the deck convert cable vibration energy into heat, and the maximum added damping is roughly proportional to the damper’s distance from the anchorage as a fraction of cable length, so effectiveness has a ceiling when deck space limits the damper position. The experience led later cable-stayed bridges to provide for dampers and vibration measures from the design stage. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Long-stay dampers” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：外置阻尼器最大附加阻尼比 ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The maximum added damping of an external damper is ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L).","failure":"常見誤解：「斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「長索阻尼器」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Long-stay dampers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-29-k1","title":"通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝","titleEn":"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers","text":"諾曼第大橋通車不久，最長的斜索出現過大的振動，管理單位隨即加裝了多套阻尼系統。長索的固有阻尼非常小（往往只有千分之幾），風雨、渦流或橋面運動只要提供少量能量，振幅就會累積到肉眼可見。","textEn":"Shortly after the Pont de Normandie opened, its longest stays showed excessive vibration, and several damping systems were quickly retrofitted. The inherent damping of long stays is very small, often only a few thousandths, so a little energy from wind and rain, vortices or deck motion can build amplitudes visible to the eye.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers\" is correct?","options":["斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。","斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。","諾曼第大橋通車不久，最長的斜索出現過大的振動，管理單位隨即加裝了多套阻尼系統。"],"optionsEn":["Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life.","With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.","Shortly after the Pont de Normandie opened, its longest stays showed excessive vibration, and several damping systems were quickly retrofitted."],"answer":2,"explanation":"諾曼第大橋通車不久，最長的斜索出現過大的振動，管理單位隨即加裝了多套阻尼系統。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Shortly after the Pont de Normandie opened, its longest stays showed excessive vibration, and several damping systems were quickly retrofitted. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b013-v13-30","title":"通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝：定量估算","titleEn":"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「長索阻尼器」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Long-stay dampers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：外置阻尼器最大附加阻尼比 ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L)。若阻尼器裝在離錨點 2.5% 索長處，ζ_max ≈ 0.025/2 = 1.25%，對數遞減率 δ = 2πζ ≈ 7.9%；若空間限制只能裝在 1.5%，ζ_max ≈ 0.75%、δ ≈ 4.7%。位置比例為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The maximum added damping of an external damper is ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L). At 2.5% of cable length from the anchorage, ζ_max ≈ 0.025/2 = 1.25% and the logarithmic decrement δ = 2πζ ≈ 7.9%; if space allows only 1.5%, ζ_max ≈ 0.75% and δ ≈ 4.7%. Position ratios are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：加裝前後以人工激振或自由衰減量測代表性長索的對數遞減率，確認達到設計目標；同時以加速度計記錄風雨事件中的振幅與頻率，比較加裝前後的最大振幅，並定期檢查阻尼器漏油與支架鬆動。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the logarithmic decrement of representative long stays before and after retrofit by manual excitation or free decay to confirm the target; record amplitudes and frequencies during wind–rain events with accelerometers to compare maximum amplitudes before and after, and inspect dampers for leaks and loose brackets periodically.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"外置阻尼器最大附加阻尼比 ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L)。若阻尼器裝在離錨點 2.5% 索長處，ζ_max ≈ 0.025/2 = 1.25%，對數遞減率 δ = 2πζ ≈ 7.9%；若空間限制只能裝在 1.5%，ζ_max ≈ 0.75%、δ ≈ 4.7%。位置比例為教學假設。","textEn":"The maximum added damping of an external damper is ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L). At 2.5% of cable length from the anchorage, ζ_max ≈ 0.025/2 = 1.25% and the logarithmic decrement δ = 2πζ ≈ 7.9%; if space allows only 1.5%, ζ_max ≈ 0.75% and δ ≈ 4.7%. Position ratios are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers\", which statement holds?","options":["外置阻尼器最大附加阻尼比 ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L)。","大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。","斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。"],"optionsEn":["The maximum added damping of an external damper is ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L).","An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight.","As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"外置阻尼器最大附加阻尼比 ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The maximum added damping of an external damper is ζ_max ≈ x_d/(2L). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b013-v13-31","title":"通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「長索阻尼器」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Long-stay dampers” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"加裝前後以人工激振或自由衰減量測代表性長索的對數遞減率，確認達到設計目標；同時以加速度計記錄風雨事件中的振幅與頻率，比較加裝前後的最大振幅，並定期檢查阻尼器漏油與支架鬆動。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the logarithmic decrement of representative long stays before and after retrofit by manual excitation or free decay to confirm the target; record amplitudes and frequencies during wind–rain events with accelerometers to compare maximum amplitudes before and after, and inspect dampers for leaks and loose brackets periodically. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：新設計的斜張橋應在設計階段就評估每根索的振動風險，預留阻尼器的安裝空間與錨固細部；既有橋若出現振動，先量測頻率與振幅再選擇阻尼器、交叉索或表面處理，並保存加裝前後的基準資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: New cable-stayed bridges should assess the vibration risk of every stay at the design stage and reserve damper space and anchorage details; on an existing bridge, measure frequency and amplitude before choosing dampers, cross-ties or surface treatment, and keep baseline data from before and after the retrofit.","failure":"注意干擾：若不處理長索振動，反覆的大振幅會讓錨口附近的鋼絞線承受彎曲疲勞，HDPE 套管與防水帽磨損失效，水分進入索體；用路人看見斜索劇烈擺動，也會影響對橋梁安全的信心。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Untreated long-stay vibration subjects strands near the anchor exit to bending fatigue and wears out the HDPE duct and caps, letting water into the cable; visible violent stay motion also shakes public confidence in the bridge. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"加裝前後以人工激振或自由衰減量測代表性長索的對數遞減率，確認達到設計目標；同時以加速度計記錄風雨事件中的振幅與頻率，比較加裝前後的最大振幅，並定期檢查阻尼器漏油與支架鬆動。","textEn":"Measure the logarithmic decrement of representative long stays before and after retrofit by manual excitation or free decay to confirm the target; record amplitudes and frequencies during wind–rain events with accelerometers to compare maximum amplitudes before and after, and inspect dampers for leaks and loose brackets periodically.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"新設計的斜張橋應在設計階段就評估每根索的振動風險，預留阻尼器的安裝空間與錨固細部；既有橋若出現振動，先量測頻率與振幅再選擇阻尼器、交叉索或表面處理，並保存加裝前後的基準資料。","textEn":"New cable-stayed bridges should assess the vibration risk of every stay at the design stage and reserve damper space and anchorage details; on an existing bridge, measure frequency and amplitude before choosing dampers, cross-ties or surface treatment, and keep baseline data from before and after the retrofit.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","加裝前後以人工激振或自由衰減量測代表性長索的對數遞減率，確認達到設計目標。","混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Measure the logarithmic decrement of representative long stays before and after retrofit by manual excitation or free decay to confirm the target.","A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"加裝前後以人工激振或自由衰減量測代表性長索的對數遞減率，確認達到設計目標；同時以加速度計記錄風雨事件中的振幅與頻率，比較加裝前後的最大振幅，並定期檢查阻尼器漏油與支架鬆動。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the logarithmic decrement of representative long stays before and after retrofit by manual excitation or free decay to confirm the target; record amplitudes and frequencies during wind–rain events with accelerometers to compare maximum amplitudes before and after, and inspect dampers for leaks and loose brackets periodically. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b013-v13-32","title":"通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝：失效診斷","titleEn":"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「長索阻尼器」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Long-stay dampers” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若不處理長索振動，反覆的大振幅會讓錨口附近的鋼絞線承受彎曲疲勞，HDPE 套管與防水帽磨損失效，水分進入索體；用路人看見斜索劇烈擺動，也會影響對橋梁安全的信心。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Untreated long-stay vibration subjects strands near the anchor exit to bending fatigue and wears out the HDPE duct and caps, letting water into the cable; visible violent stay motion also shakes public confidence in the bridge. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這次經驗也讓後來的斜張橋在設計階段就預留阻尼器與防振措施。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The experience led later cable-stayed bridges to provide for dampers and vibration measures from the design stage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「斜索振動只是外觀問題，不會影響結構壽命。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Stay vibration is only cosmetic and does not affect structural life.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若不處理長索振動，反覆的大振幅會讓錨口附近的鋼絞線承受彎曲疲勞，HDPE 套管與防水帽磨損失效，水分進入索體；用路人看見斜索劇烈擺動，也會影響對橋梁安全的信心。","textEn":"Untreated long-stay vibration subjects strands near the anchor exit to bending fatigue and wears out the HDPE duct and caps, letting water into the cable; visible violent stay motion also shakes public confidence in the bridge.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「通車後的斜索振動與阻尼器加裝」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Post-opening stay vibration and retrofitted dampers\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。","若不處理長索振動，反覆的大振幅會讓錨口附近的鋼絞線承受彎曲疲勞，HDPE 套管與防水帽磨損失效，水分進入索體；用路人看見斜索劇烈擺動，也會影響對橋梁安全的信心。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.","Untreated long-stay vibration subjects strands near the anchor exit to bending fatigue and wears out the HDPE duct and caps, letting water into the cable."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若不處理長索振動，反覆的大振幅會讓錨口附近的鋼絞線承受彎曲疲勞，HDPE 套管與防水帽磨損失效，水分進入索體；用路人看見斜索劇烈擺動，也會影響對橋梁安全的信心。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Untreated long-stay vibration subjects strands near the anchor exit to bending fatigue and wears out the HDPE duct and caps, letting water into the cable; visible violent stay motion also shakes public confidence in the bridge. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b013-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「斜索多層防腐與耐久設計」與「逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays\" and \"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b013-v13-33","title":"斜索多層防腐與耐久設計：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Wax filling and HDPE ducts” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"諾曼第大橋的斜索以蠟與聚乙烯套管保護，外層再包上具氣動外形的護套。現代鋼絞線斜索的防腐通常是多層屏障：每根鋼絲鍍鋅、鋼絞線外包蠟或油脂並擠壓一層個別的 HDPE 護套，整束再穿入外層 HDPE 套管；錨具區另有防水帽與填充材。多層屏障的意義在於任何單一層破損都不會立即讓鋼材暴露，最外層套管受紫外線、風振磨損與車輛撞擊，最內層的鋅則在水分到達時以犧牲方式保護鋼絲。耐久設計因此重在檢查每一層是否仍完整，而不是等到鋼絲生鏽。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The Pont de Normandie stays are protected by wax and polyethylene sheathing, with an outer cladding of aerodynamic profile. Modern strand stays usually have multi-layer protection: every wire is galvanised, each strand is coated in wax or grease and extruded with its own HDPE sheath, and the bundle runs inside an outer HDPE duct, with waterproof caps and filler at the anchorages. The point of multiple barriers is that no single breach exposes steel at once: the outer duct faces UV, vibration wear and vehicle impact, while the innermost zinc sacrificially protects the wires if water arrives. Durability work therefore focuses on checking that each layer is intact, not on waiting for wires to rust. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Wax filling and HDPE ducts” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：鍍鋅量 300 g/m² 約相當於 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm 的鋅層。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A zinc coating of 300 g/m² is about 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm thick.","failure":"常見誤解：「斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Wax filling and HDPE ducts”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-33-k1","title":"斜索多層防腐與耐久設計","titleEn":"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays","text":"諾曼第大橋的斜索以蠟與聚乙烯套管保護，外層再包上具氣動外形的護套。現代鋼絞線斜索的防腐通常是多層屏障：每根鋼絲鍍鋅、鋼絞線外包蠟或油脂並擠壓一層個別的 HDPE 護套，整束再穿入外層 HDPE 套管；錨具區另有防水帽與填充材。","textEn":"The Pont de Normandie stays are protected by wax and polyethylene sheathing, with an outer cladding of aerodynamic profile. Modern strand stays usually have multi-layer protection: every wire is galvanised, each strand is coated in wax or grease and extruded with its own HDPE sheath, and the bundle runs inside an outer HDPE duct, with waterproof caps and filler at the anchorages.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「斜索多層防腐與耐久設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays\" is correct?","options":["諾曼第大橋的斜索以蠟與聚乙烯套管保護，外層再包上具氣動外形的護套。","斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。","斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。"],"optionsEn":["The Pont de Normandie stays are protected by wax and polyethylene sheathing, with an outer cladding of aerodynamic profile.","With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.","A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"諾曼第大橋的斜索以蠟與聚乙烯套管保護，外層再包上具氣動外形的護套。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The Pont de Normandie stays are protected by wax and polyethylene sheathing, with an outer cladding of aerodynamic profile. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b013-v13-34","title":"斜索多層防腐與耐久設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Wax filling and HDPE ducts” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：鍍鋅量 300 g/m² 約相當於 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm 的鋅層。若外層失效、鋅以每年 1 μm 的速率消耗，約 42 年耗盡；若蠟與個別護套仍完整使速率降到每年 0.1 μm，理論壽命延長到約 420 年。鍍鋅量與速率為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A zinc coating of 300 g/m² is about 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm thick. If outer barriers fail and zinc is consumed at 1 μm a year, it lasts about 42 years; if wax and individual sheaths remain intact and slow the rate to 0.1 μm a year, the theoretical life extends to about 420 years. Coating mass and rates are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：定期以繩索技術或檢修車近距離檢查外層套管的裂縫、磨損與接頭；打開錨具防水帽檢查填充物、積水與夾片狀態；依規範在服役約 10 至 20 年後抽取單股鋼絞線做拉伸與腐蝕檢驗，評估內層防護是否仍有效。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Inspect outer ducts at close range by rope access or inspection vehicle for cracks, wear and joints; open anchorage caps to check filler, water and wedges; following recommendations, extract a single strand after about 10 to 20 years of service for tensile and corrosion testing to judge whether the inner protection still works.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"鍍鋅量 300 g/m² 約相當於 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm 的鋅層。若外層失效、鋅以每年 1 μm 的速率消耗，約 42 年耗盡；若蠟與個別護套仍完整使速率降到每年 0.1 μm，理論壽命延長到約 420 年。鍍鋅量與速率為教學假設。","textEn":"A zinc coating of 300 g/m² is about 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm thick. If outer barriers fail and zinc is consumed at 1 μm a year, it lasts about 42 years; if wax and individual sheaths remain intact and slow the rate to 0.1 μm a year, the theoretical life extends to about 420 years. Coating mass and rates are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「斜索多層防腐與耐久設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays\", which statement holds?","options":["塔的形狀只是外觀選擇，對橋面的抗風性能沒有影響。","鍍鋅量 300 g/m² 約相當於 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm 的鋅層。","塔的基礎只要總承載力夠，兩肢之間的沉陷差不重要。"],"optionsEn":["Pylon shape is purely aesthetic and does not affect the deck’s wind performance.","A zinc coating of 300 g/m² is about 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm thick.","If total capacity is enough, differential settlement between pylon legs does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鍍鋅量 300 g/m² 約相當於 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm 的鋅層。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A zinc coating of 300 g/m² is about 300/7.14 ≈ 42 μm thick. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b013-v13-35","title":"斜索多層防腐與耐久設計：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Wax filling and HDPE ducts” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"定期以繩索技術或檢修車近距離檢查外層套管的裂縫、磨損與接頭；打開錨具防水帽檢查填充物、積水與夾片狀態；依規範在服役約 10 至 20 年後抽取單股鋼絞線做拉伸與腐蝕檢驗，評估內層防護是否仍有效。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Inspect outer ducts at close range by rope access or inspection vehicle for cracks, wear and joints; open anchorage caps to check filler, water and wedges; following recommendations, extract a single strand after about 10 to 20 years of service for tensile and corrosion testing to judge whether the inner protection still works. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：檢查手冊要把錨具區列為重點，規定防水帽開啟的週期與排水孔檢查；任何套管破損都應在下一個維護週期內修補，並記錄位置以追蹤是否反覆發生。","observationEn":"Site practice: The inspection manual should prioritise anchorage zones, set intervals for opening caps and checking drain holes, repair any duct damage within the next maintenance cycle and record its location to track recurrence.","failure":"注意干擾：套管接頭開裂或錨具防水帽失效，雨水沿索流入下錨頭積聚，鋼絞線在錨口附近局部腐蝕，而這個位置正是應力集中與疲勞最嚴重的地方；外層破損若長期未修補，紫外線與水分會逐層破壞內部防護。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Cracked duct joints or failed caps let rainwater run down into the lower anchorage and pool, corroding strands right at the anchor exit where stress concentration and fatigue are worst; outer damage left unrepaired lets UV and water strip away the inner layers one by one. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"定期以繩索技術或檢修車近距離檢查外層套管的裂縫、磨損與接頭；打開錨具防水帽檢查填充物、積水與夾片狀態；依規範在服役約 10 至 20 年後抽取單股鋼絞線做拉伸與腐蝕檢驗，評估內層防護是否仍有效。","textEn":"Inspect outer ducts at close range by rope access or inspection vehicle for cracks, wear and joints; open anchorage caps to check filler, water and wedges; following recommendations, extract a single strand after about 10 to 20 years of service for tensile and corrosion testing to judge whether the inner protection still works.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"檢查手冊要把錨具區列為重點，規定防水帽開啟的週期與排水孔檢查；任何套管破損都應在下一個維護週期內修補，並記錄位置以追蹤是否反覆發生。","textEn":"The inspection manual should prioritise anchorage zones, set intervals for opening caps and checking drain holes, repair any duct damage within the next maintenance cycle and record its location to track recurrence.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「斜索多層防腐與耐久設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","斜張橋懸臂每加一節，懸臂端的變形都相同，可以用固定的修正值。","定期以繩索技術或檢修車近距離檢查外層套管的裂縫、磨損與接頭。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Each added segment deforms the cantilever tip by the same amount, so a fixed correction can be used.","Inspect outer ducts at close range by rope access or inspection vehicle for cracks, wear and joints."],"answer":2,"explanation":"定期以繩索技術或檢修車近距離檢查外層套管的裂縫、磨損與接頭；打開錨具防水帽檢查填充物、積水與夾片狀態；依規範在服役約 10 至 20 年後抽取單股鋼絞線做拉伸與腐蝕檢驗，評估內層防護是否仍有效。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Inspect outer ducts at close range by rope access or inspection vehicle for cracks, wear and joints; open anchorage caps to check filler, water and wedges; following recommendations, extract a single strand after about 10 to 20 years of service for tensile and corrosion testing to judge whether the inner protection still works. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b013-v13-36","title":"斜索多層防腐與耐久設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「蠟填充與 HDPE 套管」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wax filling and HDPE ducts” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"套管接頭開裂或錨具防水帽失效，雨水沿索流入下錨頭積聚，鋼絞線在錨口附近局部腐蝕，而這個位置正是應力集中與疲勞最嚴重的地方；外層破損若長期未修補，紫外線與水分會逐層破壞內部防護。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Cracked duct joints or failed caps let rainwater run down into the lower anchorage and pool, corroding strands right at the anchor exit where stress concentration and fatigue are worst; outer damage left unrepaired lets UV and water strip away the inner layers one by one. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：耐久設計因此重在檢查每一層是否仍完整，而不是等到鋼絲生鏽。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Durability work therefore focuses on checking that each layer is intact, not on waiting for wires to rust.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「斜索外面有 HDPE 套管，裡面的鋼絞線就永遠不會腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"With an HDPE duct outside, the strands inside can never corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"套管接頭開裂或錨具防水帽失效，雨水沿索流入下錨頭積聚，鋼絞線在錨口附近局部腐蝕，而這個位置正是應力集中與疲勞最嚴重的地方；外層破損若長期未修補，紫外線與水分會逐層破壞內部防護。","textEn":"Cracked duct joints or failed caps let rainwater run down into the lower anchorage and pool, corroding strands right at the anchor exit where stress concentration and fatigue are worst; outer damage left unrepaired lets UV and water strip away the inner layers one by one.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「斜索多層防腐與耐久設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Multi-layer corrosion protection of the stays\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["套管接頭開裂或錨具防水帽失效，雨水沿索流入下錨頭積聚，鋼絞線在錨口附近局部腐蝕，而這個位置正是應力集中與疲勞最嚴重的地方。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。"],"optionsEn":["Cracked duct joints or failed caps let rainwater run down into the lower anchorage and pool, corroding strands right at the anchor exit where stress concentration and fatigue are worst.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed."],"answer":0,"explanation":"套管接頭開裂或錨具防水帽失效，雨水沿索流入下錨頭積聚，鋼絞線在錨口附近局部腐蝕，而這個位置正是應力集中與疲勞最嚴重的地方；外層破損若長期未修補，紫外線與水分會逐層破壞內部防護。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Cracked duct joints or failed caps let rainwater run down into the lower anchorage and pool, corroding strands right at the anchor exit where stress concentration and fatigue are worst; outer damage left unrepaired lets UV and water strip away the inner layers one by one. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b013-v13-37","title":"逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「單股鋼絞線更換」如何影響諾曼第大橋的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Single-strand replacement” governs force, deformation or durability in “Pont de Normandie”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"平行鋼絞線斜索的一大優點是可以在不拆除整根索的情況下逐股抽換。抽出一股時，它原本承擔的力量會平均轉移到同一根索的其餘鋼絞線，總索力幾乎不變，因此可以在維持交通的情況下進行；新股穿入後以單股千斤頂張拉到與其他股相同的力量。諾曼第大橋由業主公會管理收費與維護，與鄰近的唐卡維爾懸索橋同屬一個營運體系。營運期的交接資料必須讓維護團隊知道每根索的股數、各股原始力量、錨具型號與防護層構造，才能安全規劃抽換。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「單股鋼絞線更換」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A major advantage of parallel-strand stays is that strands can be replaced one at a time without removing the whole cable. When one strand is withdrawn, its force spreads evenly over the remaining strands of the same stay and the total force barely changes, so work can proceed under traffic; the new strand is threaded in and stressed by a mono-strand jack to match the others. The Pont de Normandie’s owner manages tolls and maintenance together with the nearby Tancarville suspension bridge. Handover data must tell the maintenance team each stay’s strand count, original strand forces, anchorage type and protection build-up so that replacements can be planned safely. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Single-strand replacement” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：53 股斜索每股 10 t，抽出一股後其餘 52 股各增加 1/52 ≈ 1.9%，即每股約 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t，仍遠低於 27 t 破斷力；若同時抽出 3 股，每股增至約 10×53/50 = 10.6 t。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: In a 53-strand stay at 10 t per strand, withdrawing one strand raises each of the other 52 by 1/52 ≈ 1.9%, to about 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t, far below the 27 t breaking load; withdrawing 3 at once raises each to about 10×53/50 = 10.6 t.","failure":"常見誤解：「斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「單股鋼絞線更換」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Single-strand replacement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-37-k1","title":"逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接","titleEn":"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover","text":"平行鋼絞線斜索的一大優點是可以在不拆除整根索的情況下逐股抽換。抽出一股時，它原本承擔的力量會平均轉移到同一根索的其餘鋼絞線，總索力幾乎不變，因此可以在維持交通的情況下進行；新股穿入後以單股千斤頂張拉到與其他股相同的力量。","textEn":"A major advantage of parallel-strand stays is that strands can be replaced one at a time without removing the whole cable. When one strand is withdrawn, its force spreads evenly over the remaining strands of the same stay and the total force barely changes, so work can proceed under traffic; the new strand is threaded in and stressed by a mono-strand jack to match the others.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover\" is correct?","options":["斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。","平行鋼絞線斜索的一大優點是可以在不拆除整根索的情況下逐股抽換。","大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed.","A major advantage of parallel-strand stays is that strands can be replaced one at a time without removing the whole cable.","An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight."],"answer":1,"explanation":"平行鋼絞線斜索的一大優點是可以在不拆除整根索的情況下逐股抽換。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A major advantage of parallel-strand stays is that strands can be replaced one at a time without removing the whole cable. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b013-v13-38","title":"逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「單股鋼絞線更換」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Single-strand replacement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：53 股斜索每股 10 t，抽出一股後其餘 52 股各增加 1/52 ≈ 1.9%，即每股約 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t，仍遠低於 27 t 破斷力；若同時抽出 3 股，每股增至約 10×53/50 = 10.6 t。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: In a 53-strand stay at 10 t per strand, withdrawing one strand raises each of the other 52 by 1/52 ≈ 1.9%, to about 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t, far below the 27 t breaking load; withdrawing 3 at once raises each to about 10×53/50 = 10.6 t. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：抽換前以單股舉升檢測確認各股現況力量，抽換中監測索的總力與相鄰索變化，新股張拉後再以舉升檢測確認與其他股一致；抽出的舊股送實驗室做拉伸、腐蝕與疲勞檢驗，作為整體狀況評估依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before replacement, confirm current strand forces by single-strand lift-off; during the work monitor the stay’s total force and neighbouring stays; after stressing the new strand confirm by lift-off that it matches the others; send the removed strand to a laboratory for tensile, corrosion and fatigue tests as evidence of overall condition.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"53 股斜索每股 10 t，抽出一股後其餘 52 股各增加 1/52 ≈ 1.9%，即每股約 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t，仍遠低於 27 t 破斷力；若同時抽出 3 股，每股增至約 10×53/50 = 10.6 t。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"In a 53-strand stay at 10 t per strand, withdrawing one strand raises each of the other 52 by 1/52 ≈ 1.9%, to about 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t, far below the 27 t breaking load; withdrawing 3 at once raises each to about 10×53/50 = 10.6 t. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["斜索只要總索力正確，內部各股鋼絞線的力量分布無關緊要。","混凝土橋面澆好後形狀就固定了，不需要考慮之後的變形。","53 股斜索每股 10 t，抽出一股後其餘 52 股各增加 1/52 ≈ 1.9%，即每股約 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t，仍遠低於 27 t 破斷力。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the total stay force is right, how force is shared among strands does not matter.","A concrete deck’s shape is fixed once cast; later deformation need not be considered.","In a 53-strand stay at 10 t per strand, withdrawing one strand raises each of the other 52 by 1/52 ≈ 1.9%, to about 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t, far below the 27 t breaking load."],"answer":2,"explanation":"53 股斜索每股 10 t，抽出一股後其餘 52 股各增加 1/52 ≈ 1.9%，即每股約 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t，仍遠低於 27 t 破斷力；若同時抽出 3 股，每股增至約 10×53/50 = 10.6 t。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"In a 53-strand stay at 10 t per strand, withdrawing one strand raises each of the other 52 by 1/52 ≈ 1.9%, to about 10×53/52 ≈ 10.19 t, far below the 27 t breaking load; withdrawing 3 at once raises each to about 10×53/50 = 10.6 t. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b013-v13-39","title":"逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「單股鋼絞線更換」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Single-strand replacement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"抽換前以單股舉升檢測確認各股現況力量，抽換中監測索的總力與相鄰索變化，新股張拉後再以舉升檢測確認與其他股一致；抽出的舊股送實驗室做拉伸、腐蝕與疲勞檢驗，作為整體狀況評估依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before replacement, confirm current strand forces by single-strand lift-off; during the work monitor the stay’s total force and neighbouring stays; after stressing the new strand confirm by lift-off that it matches the others; send the removed strand to a laboratory for tensile, corrosion and fatigue tests as evidence of overall condition. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接資料應包含每根索的股數、安裝力量、鋼絞線批號、錨具與防護層圖說；抽換作業須有方法說明、交通與風速條件、力量容許偏差與停工條件，並由主管工程師核准後執行。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover should include each stay’s strand count, installation forces, strand lot numbers and drawings of anchorage and protection; replacement work requires a method statement, traffic and wind conditions, force tolerances and stop criteria, approved by the responsible engineer before execution.","failure":"注意干擾：若新股張拉力與其他股差異過大，受力較大的股會成為新的弱點；抽換作業未管制交通與風速，單股千斤頂與錨具區作業可能受振動干擾，增加夾片咬合不良的風險。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A new strand stressed far from the others becomes a new weak point; work without traffic and wind control lets vibration disturb mono-strand jacking at the anchorage, raising the risk of poorly seated wedges. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"抽換前以單股舉升檢測確認各股現況力量，抽換中監測索的總力與相鄰索變化，新股張拉後再以舉升檢測確認與其他股一致；抽出的舊股送實驗室做拉伸、腐蝕與疲勞檢驗，作為整體狀況評估依據。","textEn":"Before replacement, confirm current strand forces by single-strand lift-off; during the work monitor the stay’s total force and neighbouring stays; after stressing the new strand confirm by lift-off that it matches the others; send the removed strand to a laboratory for tensile, corrosion and fatigue tests as evidence of overall condition.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接資料應包含每根索的股數、安裝力量、鋼絞線批號、錨具與防護層圖說；抽換作業須有方法說明、交通與風速條件、力量容許偏差與停工條件，並由主管工程師核准後執行。","textEn":"Handover should include each stay’s strand count, installation forces, strand lot numbers and drawings of anchorage and protection; replacement work requires a method statement, traffic and wind conditions, force tolerances and stop criteria, approved by the responsible engineer before execution.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover\"?","options":["抽換前以單股舉升檢測確認各股現況力量，抽換中監測索的總力與相鄰索變化，新股張拉後再以舉升檢測確認與其他股一致。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要知道平均風速，就能決定大橋所受的風力。"],"optionsEn":["Before replacement, confirm current strand forces by single-strand lift-off.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Knowing the mean wind speed is enough to determine the wind load on a long bridge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"抽換前以單股舉升檢測確認各股現況力量，抽換中監測索的總力與相鄰索變化，新股張拉後再以舉升檢測確認與其他股一致；抽出的舊股送實驗室做拉伸、腐蝕與疲勞檢驗，作為整體狀況評估依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before replacement, confirm current strand forces by single-strand lift-off; during the work monitor the stay’s total force and neighbouring stays; after stressing the new strand confirm by lift-off that it matches the others; send the removed strand to a laboratory for tensile, corrosion and fatigue tests as evidence of overall condition. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b013-v13-40","title":"逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"prerequisiteIds":["b013-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「單股鋼絞線更換」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Single-strand replacement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若新股張拉力與其他股差異過大，受力較大的股會成為新的弱點；抽換作業未管制交通與風速，單股千斤頂與錨具區作業可能受振動干擾，增加夾片咬合不良的風險。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A new strand stressed far from the others becomes a new weak point; work without traffic and wind control lets vibration disturb mono-strand jacking at the anchorage, raising the risk of poorly seated wedges. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：營運期的交接資料必須讓維護團隊知道每根索的股數、各股原始力量、錨具型號與防護層構造，才能安全規劃抽換。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover data must tell the maintenance team each stay’s strand count, original strand forces, anchorage type and protection build-up so that replacements can be planned safely.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「斜索出問題時只能整根更換，必須封閉大橋。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A problem stay can only be replaced as a whole cable with the bridge closed.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b013-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若新股張拉力與其他股差異過大，受力較大的股會成為新的弱點；抽換作業未管制交通與風速，單股千斤頂與錨具區作業可能受振動干擾，增加夾片咬合不良的風險。","textEn":"A new strand stressed far from the others becomes a new weak point; work without traffic and wind control lets vibration disturb mono-strand jacking at the anchorage, raising the risk of poorly seated wedges.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]},{"id":"b013-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「逐股更換、營運管理與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Strand-by-strand replacement, operation and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","若新股張拉力與其他股差異過大，受力較大的股會成為新的弱點；抽換作業未管制交通與風速，單股千斤頂與錨具區作業可能受振動干擾，增加夾片咬合不良的風險。","大跨徑斜張橋的主梁全部用鋼最好，混凝土太重沒有用處。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A new strand stressed far from the others becomes a new weak point.","An all-steel deck is always best for long cable-stayed spans; concrete is just dead weight."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若新股張拉力與其他股差異過大，受力較大的股會成為新的弱點；抽換作業未管制交通與風速，單股千斤頂與錨具區作業可能受振動干擾，增加夾片咬合不良的風險。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A new strand stressed far from the others becomes a new weak point; work without traffic and wind control lets vibration disturb mono-strand jacking at the anchorage, raising the risk of poorly seated wedges. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-pnt-normandie-tech-sheet","v13s-freyssinet-cable-systems","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-en","v13s-wiki-pont-de-normandie-fr"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
